(425347, 38038, 7038, '<td valign="top">Picture seems very grainy. It looks like it may have been resampled to make it appear larger.  Nice colours however, and  straightforward compisition</td>', 'Picture seems very grainy. It looks like it may have been resampled to make it appear larger.  Nice colours however, and  straightforward compisition', '2003-09-22 01:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(425348, 38959, 8816, '<td valign="top">Should''ve save this for the ''At rest'' challenge!  NIce shot though, love the warmness of the red light, really reminds me of the warmness that I associate with sleep.</td>', 'Should''ve save this for the ''At rest'' challenge!  NIce shot though, love the warmness of the red light, really reminds me of the warmness that I associate with sleep.', '2003-09-22 01:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(425354, 38881, 11073, '<td valign="top">good dof, texture, and choice of subjects.</td>', 'good dof, texture, and choice of subjects.', '2003-09-22 01:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(425355, 38010, 2667, '<td valign="top">Sweet! I like this one very much. The shadows really make this composition stand out.</td>', 'Sweet! I like this one very much. The shadows really make this composition stand out.', '2003-09-22 01:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(425357, 38868, 11073, '<td valign="top">i like the nice warm look and lighting.</td>', 'i like the nice warm look and lighting.', '2003-09-22 01:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(425358, 38181, 8816, '<td valign="top">Would have been better in B&amp;W, but then again, I am very partial to black and white, especially in shots like this where colour is not something that helps the picture.  A nice photo, the front og the is a little blurry though, and a little less glare might have been nice.  Great composition though!  I might have also oversharpened this one a bit, to bring out the greasyness of the shot. Nonetheless I give it an 8!</td>', 'Would have been better in B&W, but then again, I am very partial to black and white, especially in shots like this where colour is not something that helps the picture.  A nice photo, the front og the is a little blurry though, and a little less glare might have been nice.  Great composition though!  I might have also oversharpened this one a bit, to bring out the greasyness of the shot. Nonetheless I give it an 8!', '2003-09-22 01:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(425359, 38592, 11073, '<td valign="top">i think that i would like it better if the center frog were looking at the camera...</td>', 'i think that i would like it better if the center frog were looking at the camera...', '2003-09-22 01:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(425362, 38807, 675, '<td valign="top">This is like, soooo 80s!!!</td>', 'This is like, soooo 80s!!!', '2003-09-22 01:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(425363, 38721, 2125, '<td valign="top">1st place Iguanateed!! 10 +  is that you jacko??<br/></td>', '1st place Iguanateed!! 10 +  is that you jacko??', '2003-09-22 01:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(425364, 38425, 2667, '<td valign="top">Superb work. I really like the clarity and detail.</td>', 'Superb work. I really like the clarity and detail.', '2003-09-22 01:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(425365, 38773, 11073, '<td valign="top">wow great shot.  was that just good timing or burst mode :)  must have been a crash landing or something :)  anyway its a great shot - good composition...although I think that you could have gotten away with cropping a little off the left...good dof, and the clarity is there. nice work.</td>', 'wow great shot.  was that just good timing or burst mode :)  must have been a crash landing or something :)  anyway its a great shot - good composition...although I think that you could have gotten away with cropping a little off the left...good dof, and the clarity is there. nice work.', '2003-09-22 01:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(425367, 38871, 8816, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  My fav so far.  The darkness around her mouth (though many will not agree) enhances what the title states.  This image is very clear, and well saturated.  The pattern and color of the fabric on her shoulder make her dark, and foreign looks, even more beautiful then they already are.  Composition is great, I would have liked to see a little less light around her eye perhaps, but thats my only quibble! Awesome work, 10!</td>', 'Excellent.  My fav so far.  The darkness around her mouth (though many will not agree) enhances what the title states.  This image is very clear, and well saturated.  The pattern and color of the fabric on her shoulder make her dark, and foreign looks, even more beautiful then they already are.  Composition is great, I would have liked to see a little less light around her eye perhaps, but thats my only quibble! Awesome work, 10!', '2003-09-22 01:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(425368, 37984, 6668, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and great shot.</td>', 'Great idea, and great shot.', '2003-09-22 01:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(425369, 38665, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow - now that''s what I call a macro!  You took ''up close and personal'' to a new level.  Excellent work, I see a ribbon in it''s future!  -10</td>', 'Wow - now that''s what I call a macro!  You took ''up close and personal'' to a new level.  Excellent work, I see a ribbon in it''s future!  -10', '2003-09-22 01:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(425371, 38998, 714, '<td valign="top">lovely shot. the only complaint is how bright it is...I would wait till later in the day or put something in front of the flower to block the sun.  Good luck</td>', 'lovely shot. the only complaint is how bright it is...I would wait till later in the day or put something in front of the flower to block the sun.  Good luck', '2003-09-22 01:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(425372, 38667, 6668, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and textures in this shot, the slight blurring on the objects in the front is a little distracting though.</td>', 'I really like the colors and textures in this shot, the slight blurring on the objects in the front is a little distracting though.', '2003-09-22 01:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
