(425753, 38741, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot, really nice DOF, the back part of the lighter is as blurred as it gets. Only thing I would like to see on this shot is the dark part in the top left corner whiter (not that big of a flaw if you ask me) 8</td>', 'Great shot, really nice DOF, the back part of the lighter is as blurred as it gets. Only thing I would like to see on this shot is the dark part in the top left corner whiter (not that big of a flaw if you ask me) 8', '2003-09-22 09:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
