(425762, 38888, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, I''m not sure if the photo is grainy or just the texture of the metal, seems a little hard to focus on.</td>', 'Nice colors, I''m not sure if the photo is grainy or just the texture of the metal, seems a little hard to focus on.', '2003-09-22 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
