(425821, 38739, 92, '<td valign="top">This would be just about perfect for me without the matches. They (for me) don''t add anything to the photo. The watch has perfect light, DOF and color tones. I really like that part of it a LOT :)</td>', 'This would be just about perfect for me without the matches. They (for me) don''t add anything to the photo. The watch has perfect light, DOF and color tones. I really like that part of it a LOT :)', '2003-09-22 10:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
