(426293, 38995, 7889, '<td valign="top">The dof works well here and the white on the dark background is good. nice.</td>', 'The dof works well here and the white on the dark background is good. nice.', '2003-09-22 15:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(426294, 38283, 327, '<td valign="top">Just lovely lighting and focus. This fly has seen better days. :) Neat shot, great work.</td>', 'Just lovely lighting and focus. This fly has seen better days. :) Neat shot, great work.', '2003-09-22 15:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(426295, 38011, 327, '<td valign="top">Like this. Very masculine shot. Wonderful light and focus.</td>', 'Like this. Very masculine shot. Wonderful light and focus.', '2003-09-22 15:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(426296, 38975, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, unusual. Love the colors.</td>', 'Interesting shot, unusual. Love the colors.', '2003-09-22 15:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(426297, 38998, 327, '<td valign="top">Good crop and colors.</td>', 'Good crop and colors.', '2003-09-22 15:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(426298, 38876, 327, '<td valign="top">Good work. Light is a bit harsh on some of the white but that seems to add to the over all contrast. Hope he used his sun block. Good shooting.</td>', 'Good work. Light is a bit harsh on some of the white but that seems to add to the over all contrast. Hope he used his sun block. Good shooting.', '2003-09-22 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(426300, 38999, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning macro. Love the colors and light.</td>', 'Stunning macro. Love the colors and light.', '2003-09-22 16:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(426301, 38001, 7889, '<td valign="top">This would have been better if you had cropped the shot to get rid of the green. good dof in this and i like the colours.</td>', 'This would have been better if you had cropped the shot to get rid of the green. good dof in this and i like the colours.', '2003-09-22 16:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(426304, 39007, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this. I would of liked better light on the pencil, it appears a bit harsh and causes a glare. Sounds picky I know but being honest with my thoughts. The drawing is so good. Talented. I think this whole shot is very good and loved looking at it. Thanks for submitting.</td>', 'I like this. I would of liked better light on the pencil, it appears a bit harsh and causes a glare. Sounds picky I know but being honest with my thoughts. The drawing is so good. Talented. I think this whole shot is very good and loved looking at it. Thanks for submitting.', '2003-09-22 16:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(426308, 38857, 327, '<td valign="top">Great bug-eye. Love the foucs and the colors. You did very well here, and have a super nice lens. This is a busy shot and I wonder if a tighter crop would of focused the viewer on the main subject? Good work.</td>', 'Great bug-eye. Love the foucs and the colors. You did very well here, and have a super nice lens. This is a busy shot and I wonder if a tighter crop would of focused the viewer on the main subject? Good work.', '2003-09-22 16:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(426311, 38939, 327, '<td valign="top">Really set this up nicely. I love the repetition and the shadows. Great light.</td>', 'Really set this up nicely. I love the repetition and the shadows. Great light.', '2003-09-22 16:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(426312, 38760, 7889, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better with a darker background maybe. great colours</td>', 'I think this would have worked better with a darker background maybe. great colours', '2003-09-22 16:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(426314, 38477, 7889, '<td valign="top">There are just too many of this type of shot!</td>', 'There are just too many of this type of shot!', '2003-09-22 16:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(426317, 38793, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice background/light. Good job.</td>', 'Nice background/light. Good job.', '2003-09-22 16:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(426318, 38981, 9131, '<td valign="top">very cool effect! how''d you do it??</td>', 'very cool effect! how''d you do it??', '2003-09-22 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(426320, 38399, 9131, '<td valign="top">i''d have liked the feather by itself...nice shot, though.</td>', 'i''d have liked the feather by itself...nice shot, though.', '2003-09-22 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(426321, 38999, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent detail and color :)  = 10</td>', 'excellent detail and color :)  = 10', '2003-09-22 16:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(426322, 38879, 9131, '<td valign="top">neat shot, but i think it would be better if focus was shifted back just a bit, to get the eye to be the point of best focus.  the reflection in the eye would then be very striking.</td>', 'neat shot, but i think it would be better if focus was shifted back just a bit, to get the eye to be the point of best focus.  the reflection in the eye would then be very striking.', '2003-09-22 16:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(426323, 38959, 327, '<td valign="top">WoW!! I love her, love the pose and the color makes her look sooo mysterious and exotic. This is so nice. Congrats.</td>', 'WoW!! I love her, love the pose and the color makes her look sooo mysterious and exotic. This is so nice. Congrats.', '2003-09-22 16:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(426324, 38990, 9131, '<td valign="top">nice shot! good depth, and i like the exposure because it is dark so that the face of the cork almost floats in front of the frame.</td>', 'nice shot! good depth, and i like the exposure because it is dark so that the face of the cork almost floats in front of the frame.', '2003-09-22 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(426325, 38060, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. Not crazy about the smudge on the tile to the right and I believe the focus could of been somewhat sharper. Still I like your shot very much.</td>', 'Neat shot. Not crazy about the smudge on the tile to the right and I believe the focus could of been somewhat sharper. Still I like your shot very much.', '2003-09-22 16:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(426326, 38665, 327, '<td valign="top">Hummm, yummy shot. The eyes are fantastic. Not crazy about the crop. However, this is fine.</td>', 'Hummm, yummy shot. The eyes are fantastic. Not crazy about the crop. However, this is fine.', '2003-09-22 16:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(426327, 38476, 327, '<td valign="top">Big WOW from me......great glass, great color, great focus. WOW.</td>', 'Big WOW from me......great glass, great color, great focus. WOW.', '2003-09-22 16:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(426328, 37864, 9131, '<td valign="top">what a face!  the lighting could be improved, so that the eye had brilliant light on it. also seems to be a little on the grainy/sharp side. otherwise very nice!</td>', 'what a face!  the lighting could be improved, so that the eye had brilliant light on it. also seems to be a little on the grainy/sharp side. otherwise very nice!', '2003-09-22 16:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(426329, 38300, 327, '<td valign="top">love the dof, the perspective and the b&amp;w. Good work. Really nice.</td>', 'love the dof, the perspective and the b&w. Good work. Really nice.', '2003-09-22 16:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(426330, 38909, 9131, '<td valign="top">strange.  i can''t make out exactly what it is, but that makes it a compelling shot.</td>', 'strange.  i can''t make out exactly what it is, but that makes it a compelling shot.', '2003-09-22 16:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(426331, 37864, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop on the right side...pretty fried there. However....this is so nice on the left. Great shadow/light and the color is just creepy!! Great work. Really a neat beast.</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop on the right side...pretty fried there. However....this is so nice on the left. Great shadow/light and the color is just creepy!! Great work. Really a neat beast.', '2003-09-22 16:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(426332, 38996, 9131, '<td valign="top">crisper focus would make this a much nicer shot.</td>', 'crisper focus would make this a much nicer shot.', '2003-09-22 16:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(426333, 38283, 9131, '<td valign="top">a real bug?  nice focus/depth!</td>', 'a real bug?  nice focus/depth!', '2003-09-22 16:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(426336, 38188, 9906, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be a touch soft.  Too bad the M''s are washed out.  Great composition!!<br/>TC</td>', 'Focus seems to be a touch soft.  Too bad the M''s are washed out.  Great composition!!TC', '2003-09-22 16:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(426343, 38278, 327, '<td valign="top">Humorous, great light and shadow. I do think the egg should of been a bit more in focus or moved the back a bit. Still I do like this....it''s simple, fun and interesting to view. Great job.</td>', 'Humorous, great light and shadow. I do think the egg should of been a bit more in focus or moved the back a bit. Still I do like this....it''s simple, fun and interesting to view. Great job.', '2003-09-22 16:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
