(426469, 38477, 7628, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever seen a penny so well.  Nicely done.  Focus a bit soft.  Wish the subject had more context/interest.</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever seen a penny so well.  Nicely done.  Focus a bit soft.  Wish the subject had more context/interest.', '2003-09-22 18:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(426470, 38298, 327, '<td valign="top">Very wonderful tones...clean/crisp. Nice work.</td>', 'Very wonderful tones...clean/crisp. Nice work.', '2003-09-22 18:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(426473, 38677, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot...looks like it''s right out of the movies. I sure hope he doesn''t know where I live.</td>', 'Neat shot...looks like it''s right out of the movies. I sure hope he doesn''t know where I live.', '2003-09-22 18:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(426474, 38967, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.  Wish you could have used lighting to differentiate between the white of the mints and the white of the background - I know its is supposed to be subtle, but it is a bit too subtle for me.  Great blue.  I''m not seeing much detail or texture which I feel is the point of macro.</td>', 'I like this idea.  Wish you could have used lighting to differentiate between the white of the mints and the white of the background - I know its is supposed to be subtle, but it is a bit too subtle for me.  Great blue.  I''m not seeing much detail or texture which I feel is the point of macro.', '2003-09-22 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(426475, 38010, 7291, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time figruing out how you accomplished such a hard contrast with shadow and light but the effect is truly amazing.  This has instantly become one of my favorite DPC pictures. - 10</td>', 'I''m having a hard time figruing out how you accomplished such a hard contrast with shadow and light but the effect is truly amazing.  This has instantly become one of my favorite DPC pictures. - 10', '2003-09-22 18:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(426476, 37864, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the smoothness in the pic. Wish the lighting were more even - not so bright on the nose and elbow,</td>', 'I like the smoothness in the pic. Wish the lighting were more even - not so bright on the nose and elbow,', '2003-09-22 18:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(426477, 38408, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow/light.</td>', 'Nice shadow/light.', '2003-09-22 18:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(426479, 38963, 7628, '<td valign="top">wow! eyes! nicely depicted.  Doo detail and texture.  Light is a bit glaring in spots</td>', 'wow! eyes! nicely depicted.  Doo detail and texture.  Light is a bit glaring in spots', '2003-09-22 18:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(426480, 38999, 11506, '<td valign="top">Holy Crap!  You can see the condensation on its face!  Nice work</td>', 'Holy Crap!  You can see the condensation on its face!  Nice work', '2003-09-22 18:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(426481, 38726, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus and colors. I do believe there is a lot going on in this shot and it''s hard for the eye to land. Maybe a tighter crop on just the bee. Don''t take me wrong.....this is fantastic..Congrats.</td>', 'Wonderful focus and colors. I do believe there is a lot going on in this shot and it''s hard for the eye to land. Maybe a tighter crop on just the bee. Don''t take me wrong.....this is fantastic..Congrats.', '2003-09-22 18:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(426483, 38724, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice motion, nice diagonal composition.</td>', 'nice motion, nice diagonal composition.', '2003-09-22 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(426484, 38352, 327, '<td valign="top">I love shadow and light shots. Something very intriguing to photograph. Here I don''t really see this shot as a macro. &lt;?&gt; I do see this as a nice shot with wonderful greens and light.</td>', 'I love shadow and light shots. Something very intriguing to photograph. Here I don''t really see this shot as a macro. <?> I do see this as a nice shot with wonderful greens and light.', '2003-09-22 18:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(426485, 38763, 7628, '<td valign="top">A lovely piece of jewelry.  I wish the light picked out the details better, and the focus was as clear as the diamonds.</td>', 'A lovely piece of jewelry.  I wish the light picked out the details better, and the focus was as clear as the diamonds.', '2003-09-22 18:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(426486, 38800, 327, '<td valign="top">Yikes that is a bad guy if I ever saw one. Good colors, good idea.</td>', 'Yikes that is a bad guy if I ever saw one. Good colors, good idea.', '2003-09-22 18:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(426487, 39001, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field really brings the bird out of the picture. Love the details in the fur.  I think it needs a little more gel or hairspray.</td>', 'Great depth of field really brings the bird out of the picture. Love the details in the fur.  I think it needs a little more gel or hairspray.', '2003-09-22 18:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(426488, 38982, 7628, '<td valign="top">fun, very imaginative composition.  What would it look like with a darker background? A little more light?</td>', 'fun, very imaginative composition.  What would it look like with a darker background? A little more light?', '2003-09-22 18:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(426490, 38760, 7628, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors, very simple but compelling composition,  Oh! I wish it were sharp focus!</td>', 'wonderful colors, very simple but compelling composition,  Oh! I wish it were sharp focus!', '2003-09-22 18:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(426492, 38892, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details and sharpness. The desaturation of the colors really bring out the insect. It really makes it pop out of the picture. Beautiful shadows also in the hive.</td>', 'Beautiful details and sharpness. The desaturation of the colors really bring out the insect. It really makes it pop out of the picture. Beautiful shadows also in the hive.', '2003-09-22 18:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(426495, 38981, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Beautiful sharpness in the shot. The burnt wax with it''s ash make the candle real. Love the sparks lighting up the background. Gives the shot even more interest.</td>', 'Great composition. Beautiful sharpness in the shot. The burnt wax with it''s ash make the candle real. Love the sparks lighting up the background. Gives the shot even more interest.', '2003-09-22 18:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(426498, 38677, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting. The shadows and the reflections of the light really bring Pumpkinhead alive. The great depth of field makes the picture look almost like an abstract drawing, yet it still looks alive.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting. The shadows and the reflections of the light really bring Pumpkinhead alive. The great depth of field makes the picture look almost like an abstract drawing, yet it still looks alive.', '2003-09-22 18:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(426503, 38283, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredible details in the fly. Every hair can be seen perfectly. Love the light and shadows in the coin. The reflections in the wings are absolutely beautiful. Wow.</td>', 'Incredible details in the fly. Every hair can be seen perfectly. Love the light and shadows in the coin. The reflections in the wings are absolutely beautiful. Wow.', '2003-09-22 18:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(426532, 38947, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the context - how this coin sits on top of others, but stands out in focus and detail.</td>', 'I like the context - how this coin sits on top of others, but stands out in focus and detail.', '2003-09-22 19:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(426542, 38046, 10084, '<td valign="top">Love the angle you used, just like in the shows. I makes it seem to be flying toward us. Lighting really bring out the details in the subject. Great composition.</td>', 'Love the angle you used, just like in the shows. I makes it seem to be flying toward us. Lighting really bring out the details in the subject. Great composition.', '2003-09-22 19:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(426548, 38655, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The lighting and the shadows really make the hand and ball pop out of the picture. Incredible details in the hand. You can see the fingerprints off of the fingers. Wow. Love the glow of color in the bottom of the sphere.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The lighting and the shadows really make the hand and ball pop out of the picture. Incredible details in the hand. You can see the fingerprints off of the fingers. Wow. Love the glow of color in the bottom of the sphere.', '2003-09-22 19:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(426582, 38931, 4210, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little bit weird, but I think the shell in the background was a good choice.</td>', 'Lighting is a little bit weird, but I think the shell in the background was a good choice.', '2003-09-22 19:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(426583, 38897, 4210, '<td valign="top">I know alot of people are not going to like the dof on this shot, but I think it''s nice. The colours and the lighting is great, and so is the composition.</td>', 'I know alot of people are not going to like the dof on this shot, but I think it''s nice. The colours and the lighting is great, and so is the composition.', '2003-09-22 19:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(426584, 39011, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting boarder choice. I like the colours, but it does seem a little bit bright.</td>', 'Interesting boarder choice. I like the colours, but it does seem a little bit bright.', '2003-09-22 19:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(426586, 38677, 4210, '<td valign="top">Wow... that''s actually pretty scary. The head seems like it''s popping out of the monitor. Eeep! Great use of dof.</td>', 'Wow... that''s actually pretty scary. The head seems like it''s popping out of the monitor. Eeep! Great use of dof.', '2003-09-22 19:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
