(426617, 38876, 4210, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to think of maybe something else you could have used as a living prop, but nothing comes to mind. Idonno, but I just don''t like that ant.</td>', 'I''m trying to think of maybe something else you could have used as a living prop, but nothing comes to mind. Idonno, but I just don''t like that ant.', '2003-09-22 20:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(426619, 38956, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract. I''m wondering what kind of camera you have. Seems a little noisy.</td>', 'Very nice abstract. I''m wondering what kind of camera you have. Seems a little noisy.', '2003-09-22 20:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(426620, 38480, 4210, '<td valign="top">Looks very much like a snapshot. General out of focusness, although maybe that''s what you were going for. Try experimenting with different angles, and filling the frame.</td>', 'Looks very much like a snapshot. General out of focusness, although maybe that''s what you were going for. Try experimenting with different angles, and filling the frame.', '2003-09-22 20:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(426622, 38623, 10040, '<td valign="top">Based on a certain post today regarding background materials, I am going to go out on a limb and say this is a ScottK photograph.  The black foam is a dead give away, LOL.  Shoot, if I am wrong I am going to feel stupid.  As for the photo, I really like it.  I think the reflections in the balls are a nice touch.</td>', 'Based on a certain post today regarding background materials, I am going to go out on a limb and say this is a ScottK photograph.  The black foam is a dead give away, LOL.  Shoot, if I am wrong I am going to feel stupid.  As for the photo, I really like it.  I think the reflections in the balls are a nice touch.', '2003-09-22 20:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(426624, 38665, 10040, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  It is amazing how complex bugs eyes are when seen at this level.  Once the challenge is over some spot editing to get rid of the imperfections will really make this an incredible shot.  I really like the border too.  Some people tend to overdue it with borders, but I think in this case, it helps the photo.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  It is amazing how complex bugs eyes are when seen at this level.  Once the challenge is over some spot editing to get rid of the imperfections will really make this an incredible shot.  I really like the border too.  Some people tend to overdue it with borders, but I think in this case, it helps the photo.  Great job!', '2003-09-22 20:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(426625, 38292, 10040, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like the composition and the subject matter, but I think the surface it was placed on may be detracting from the main subject.  There is almost too much texture in it.</td>', 'Nice job.  I like the composition and the subject matter, but I think the surface it was placed on may be detracting from the main subject.  There is almost too much texture in it.', '2003-09-22 20:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(426626, 38760, 10040, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, nice colors.  There unfortunately seems to be a lot of "noise" in the image.  Could be my monitor though.</td>', 'Nice photo, nice colors.  There unfortunately seems to be a lot of "noise" in the image.  Could be my monitor though.', '2003-09-22 20:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(426628, 38824, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Love the yellows. Interesting way you were able to compose the shot. It seems very much like a comic book shot. The hairs on the insect seem to intersect toward the middle thus making your eyes focus in on the shiny part of the insect. Blurring effect is interesting.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Love the yellows. Interesting way you were able to compose the shot. It seems very much like a comic book shot. The hairs on the insect seem to intersect toward the middle thus making your eyes focus in on the shiny part of the insect. Blurring effect is interesting.', '2003-09-22 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(426629, 38005, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details in the sand dollar. Love the shadows in the grooves. It really makes the details pop out of the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful details in the sand dollar. Love the shadows in the grooves. It really makes the details pop out of the shot.', '2003-09-22 20:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(426631, 38982, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting makes the piece interesting. The shadows and the reflections of the light give great details in the bristles in the toothbrush. The insect has some beautiful colors that draw your eyes to it.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting makes the piece interesting. The shadows and the reflections of the light give great details in the bristles in the toothbrush. The insect has some beautiful colors that draw your eyes to it.', '2003-09-22 20:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(426632, 37864, 10040, '<td valign="top">I have NEVER seen a frog like that!  Great picture!  Some spot editing after the challenge will make this photo incredible.  The background compliments this shot beautifully.</td>', 'I have NEVER seen a frog like that!  Great picture!  Some spot editing after the challenge will make this photo incredible.  The background compliments this shot beautifully.', '2003-09-22 20:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(426633, 38955, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredible contrast really makes this a great vivid picture. The beautiful depth of field makes the butterfly come alive.  You can almost feel the grain of the wood also. Frame work great with the picture without taking away anything. Shadows and reflections in the wing gives you a sense of texture of them.</td>', 'Incredible contrast really makes this a great vivid picture. The beautiful depth of field makes the butterfly come alive.  You can almost feel the grain of the wood also. Frame work great with the picture without taking away anything. Shadows and reflections in the wing gives you a sense of texture of them.', '2003-09-22 20:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(426635, 38399, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful colors in the shot.  Incredible shadows and reflections in the piece really make the shot interesting.</td>', 'Very beautiful colors in the shot.  Incredible shadows and reflections in the piece really make the shot interesting.', '2003-09-22 20:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(426638, 38146, 10040, '<td valign="top">The blue background seems to have a lot of "noise".  A slight Gaussian Blur in Photoshop (if you have it) would have helped a bit.  Not too much though or it would start blurring the clean features in the face.  Nice shot though -- it''s simple, it''s clear.  Is that one of the Rodan''s in Philadelphia btw?</td>', 'The blue background seems to have a lot of "noise".  A slight Gaussian Blur in Photoshop (if you have it) would have helped a bit.  Not too much though or it would start blurring the clean features in the face.  Nice shot though -- it''s simple, it''s clear.  Is that one of the Rodan''s in Philadelphia btw?', '2003-09-22 20:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(426640, 39007, 10040, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, nice drawing.  You seem to be talented in many areas ;)</td>', 'Nice photo, nice drawing.  You seem to be talented in many areas ;)', '2003-09-22 20:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(426641, 38298, 10040, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Perfectly in focus.  I like the off-center composition of it.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Perfectly in focus.  I like the off-center composition of it.', '2003-09-22 20:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(426643, 38088, 10040, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, great lighting!  My only suggestion would have been to crop it in a little on the right side.  It looks like there is the tip of a finger on the right.</td>', 'Great clarity, great lighting!  My only suggestion would have been to crop it in a little on the right side.  It looks like there is the tip of a finger on the right.', '2003-09-22 20:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(426644, 38836, 10040, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Beautiful lighting.  Simple, clean, pure.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Beautiful lighting.  Simple, clean, pure.', '2003-09-22 20:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(426645, 38972, 10040, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Clear and in focus.  I like the off-center composition.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Clear and in focus.  I like the off-center composition.', '2003-09-22 20:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(426647, 38871, 10040, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Great lighting and a very beautiful woman.  It''s nice to see someone take a picture of something other than an object, insect, or flower for this challenge -- very refreshing.  My only suggestion might be to crop out the bricks on the right.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Great lighting and a very beautiful woman.  It''s nice to see someone take a picture of something other than an object, insect, or flower for this challenge -- very refreshing.  My only suggestion might be to crop out the bricks on the right.', '2003-09-22 20:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(426648, 38568, 10040, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this one.  Great shot!</td>', 'I love the colors in this one.  Great shot!', '2003-09-22 20:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(426650, 37882, 9385, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with excellent detail and color. I found the wide frame to be distracting.</td>', 'Wonderful shot with excellent detail and color. I found the wide frame to be distracting.', '2003-09-22 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(426651, 39005, 10040, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  What kind of animal is that?  I am going to guess a deer.</td>', 'Great shot!  What kind of animal is that?  I am going to guess a deer.', '2003-09-22 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(426652, 38982, 6668, '<td valign="top">interesting and unique subject....I hope you didn''t use the toothbrush after :-)</td>', 'interesting and unique subject....I hope you didn''t use the toothbrush after :-)', '2003-09-22 20:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(426654, 38260, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Profile of the deer makes it interesting. Love the furriness of the elk. I think more lighting on the elk itself would really make it pop out. The fur if you have the right light really makes it shine. The green in the background helps to make the subject come out of the picture.</td>', 'Great composition. Profile of the deer makes it interesting. Love the furriness of the elk. I think more lighting on the elk itself would really make it pop out. The fur if you have the right light really makes it shine. The green in the background helps to make the subject come out of the picture.', '2003-09-22 20:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(426655, 38909, 10040, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-09-22 20:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(426657, 38283, 10040, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!', '2003-09-22 20:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(426658, 38792, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness in the picture. I like that you can pick out all the details of each strand of wheat. The black background really makes the wheat pop out of the shot. Beautiful lighting.</td>', 'Great sharpness in the picture. I like that you can pick out all the details of each strand of wheat. The black background really makes the wheat pop out of the shot. Beautiful lighting.', '2003-09-22 21:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
