(426689, 38914, 4871, '<td valign="top">Very nice! How''d you get the pin to stand up? Love the contrast! One thing to mention - pity about the little spot of white under the string on the LHS and various spots over the black as it ruins a perfect black. Maybe brightness and contrast would have helped this?</td>', 'Very nice! How''d you get the pin to stand up? Love the contrast! One thing to mention - pity about the little spot of white under the string on the LHS and various spots over the black as it ruins a perfect black. Maybe brightness and contrast would have helped this?', '2003-09-22 21:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(426690, 38824, 4871, '<td valign="top">Wow - how close can you get? Great shot! A sharpen wouldn''t have gone wrong on this pic.</td>', 'Wow - how close can you get? Great shot! A sharpen wouldn''t have gone wrong on this pic.', '2003-09-22 21:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(426692, 38734, 4871, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, although the highlights are a bit hot. I would have also been a little closer to the nuts rather than having the leaves on the right as then you would have seen more detail of the nuts. Still, very nice photo.</td>', 'Love the lighting, although the highlights are a bit hot. I would have also been a little closer to the nuts rather than having the leaves on the right as then you would have seen more detail of the nuts. Still, very nice photo.', '2003-09-22 21:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
