(427170, 38592, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great Shot! Outstanding colors! Love the title..that was a clever play on words. The lighting is interesting and adds dimension to the shot! I love it! Outstanding job!</td>', 'Great Shot! Outstanding colors! Love the title..that was a clever play on words. The lighting is interesting and adds dimension to the shot! I love it! Outstanding job!', '2003-09-23 12:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
