(427263, 38807, 10608, '<td valign="top">Very original and I love it! Had no idea what it was until I read the title...good job</td>', 'Very original and I love it! Had no idea what it was until I read the title...good job', '2003-09-23 15:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
