(427271, 38228, 10608, '<td valign="top">A truly fantastic shot and deserves a thumbsup</td>', 'A truly fantastic shot and deserves a thumbsup', '2003-09-23 15:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(427272, 38465, 9504, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred second hand.  Nice action shot of passing time.  However, the watch is really warn, and isn''t appealing to look at.  A clock with some personality might have faired better.</td>', 'I like the blurred second hand.  Nice action shot of passing time.  However, the watch is really warn, and isn''t appealing to look at.  A clock with some personality might have faired better.', '2003-09-23 15:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(427273, 38038, 9504, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this shot, the colors -- everything except I find the photo focus is too soft.  If this were crisp, you''d rate in the top 5% with this photo.</td>', 'I love the composition of this shot, the colors -- everything except I find the photo focus is too soft.  If this were crisp, you''d rate in the top 5% with this photo.', '2003-09-23 15:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(427274, 38010, 9504, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, shadows, perspective -- everything.  Quite an exceptional shot of the subject.</td>', 'I love the colors, shadows, perspective -- everything.  Quite an exceptional shot of the subject.', '2003-09-23 15:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(427277, 38005, 9504, '<td valign="top">When I look at this photo,  I want to scroll it down so I can see the top of the sand dollar.  Somehow, it doesn''t work well for me that the top section is cut off. You should play around with different photos of different sections of the SD.  The texture of the sand dollar is very interesting to look at.  Good color tones.</td>', 'When I look at this photo,  I want to scroll it down so I can see the top of the sand dollar.  Somehow, it doesn''t work well for me that the top section is cut off. You should play around with different photos of different sections of the SD.  The texture of the sand dollar is very interesting to look at.  Good color tones.', '2003-09-23 15:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(427279, 38874, 9504, '<td valign="top">This photo is dark however I think you were trying to accomplish a mood -- like a painting.  Yes?  It is interesting, but I think the lighting could have been improved and still given you the same effect. Nice composition.</td>', 'This photo is dark however I think you were trying to accomplish a mood -- like a painting.  Yes?  It is interesting, but I think the lighting could have been improved and still given you the same effect. Nice composition.', '2003-09-23 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(427281, 38824, 9504, '<td valign="top">EXTREME CLOSE-UP huh?  I love the detail, the color -- everything except the angle of the photo.  It somehow distracts from the subject.</td>', 'EXTREME CLOSE-UP huh?  I love the detail, the color -- everything except the angle of the photo.  It somehow distracts from the subject.', '2003-09-23 15:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(427284, 38971, 9504, '<td valign="top">I love creative minds because I am not the creative type.  When I look at your photo, I say to myself, "Wow!  What a neat idea!  It''s so interesting.  You''d never think of this in a million years!"<br/> <br/>I just love this -- the colors -- the constrast-- the focus -- the white background -- the subjects!<br/> <br/>GREAT JOB!</td>', 'I love creative minds because I am not the creative type.  When I look at your photo, I say to myself, "Wow!  What a neat idea!  It''s so interesting.  You''d never think of this in a million years!" I just love this -- the colors -- the constrast-- the focus -- the white background -- the subjects! GREAT JOB!', '2003-09-23 15:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(427286, 38188, 9504, '<td valign="top">These M&amp;Ms look odd to me.  Were they old or did the camera not capture them well?  What are they on top of?</td>', 'These M&Ms look odd to me.  Were they old or did the camera not capture them well?  What are they on top of?', '2003-09-23 15:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(427287, 38996, 9504, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white, nice textures, nice composition.</td>', 'Nice black and white, nice textures, nice composition.', '2003-09-23 15:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(427289, 38782, 9504, '<td valign="top">You have a great idea here -- I just think the depth of field is too narrow.</td>', 'You have a great idea here -- I just think the depth of field is too narrow.', '2003-09-23 15:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(427290, 38296, 9504, '<td valign="top">Simply wild looking!</td>', 'Simply wild looking!', '2003-09-23 16:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(427292, 38480, 9504, '<td valign="top">You have a neat idea here, but I find the angle odd and the background counter distracting.  If this were on a black background/backdrop and you were looking at it head on -- you''d have it nailed.  This angle makes me feel like I am going to get a stiff neck.</td>', 'You have a neat idea here, but I find the angle odd and the background counter distracting.  If this were on a black background/backdrop and you were looking at it head on -- you''d have it nailed.  This angle makes me feel like I am going to get a stiff neck.', '2003-09-23 16:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(427296, 38384, 9504, '<td valign="top">Rose Mallow.  I love these flowers.  They are so incredible!  Nice capture.</td>', 'Rose Mallow.  I love these flowers.  They are so incredible!  Nice capture.', '2003-09-23 16:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(427297, 38620, 9504, '<td valign="top">The bluish-cast seems a little odd in color.  It doesn''t appear natural...</td>', 'The bluish-cast seems a little odd in color.  It doesn''t appear natural...', '2003-09-23 16:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(427298, 38366, 9504, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrasting colors!  I love the red and yellow.</td>', 'Excellent contrasting colors!  I love the red and yellow.', '2003-09-23 16:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(427301, 38803, 9504, '<td valign="top">This would have been more interesting if you would have cropped out more the green grass.</td>', 'This would have been more interesting if you would have cropped out more the green grass.', '2003-09-23 16:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(427302, 38955, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;W where it must have been tempting to use colour.</td>', 'Nice use of B&W where it must have been tempting to use colour.', '2003-09-23 16:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(427303, 38409, 9504, '<td valign="top">Nice entry -- but consider not putting the date on the photo.</td>', 'Nice entry -- but consider not putting the date on the photo.', '2003-09-23 16:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(427304, 38879, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness in front of the eye, but the reflection in the eyeball is too over powering.</td>', 'Good sharpness in front of the eye, but the reflection in the eyeball is too over powering.', '2003-09-23 16:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(427307, 38623, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nece effect, but would be better with an abstract reflection rather than being able to see the photographer. Should the front ball be in focus, or should the pile? Difficult question...</td>', 'Nece effect, but would be better with an abstract reflection rather than being able to see the photographer. Should the front ball be in focus, or should the pile? Difficult question...', '2003-09-23 16:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(427308, 38760, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and string shapes. Needs more DOF.</td>', 'Nice colours and string shapes. Needs more DOF.', '2003-09-23 16:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(427310, 38807, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Showing more of the nail might make it more obvious what it is. Like the graduated background.</td>', 'Nice. Showing more of the nail might make it more obvious what it is. Like the graduated background.', '2003-09-23 16:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(427312, 38384, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp with good DOF. Nice exposure, too.</td>', 'Nice and sharp with good DOF. Nice exposure, too.', '2003-09-23 16:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(427315, 38038, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the colours look wrong - not sure why. Would have worked better in a landscape format, I think.</td>', 'Nice, but the colours look wrong - not sure why. Would have worked better in a landscape format, I think.', '2003-09-23 16:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(427316, 38881, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings :)  This is a wonderfully ''moody'' black and white.  The light/dark contrasts in this image create a nice sense of depth, and that is also strengthened by the depth of field choice.  I believe that good black and white photos have strong characteristics in contrast and texture, and this has both... excellent work :) = 10</td>', 'Greetings :)  This is a wonderfully ''moody'' black and white.  The light/dark contrasts in this image create a nice sense of depth, and that is also strengthened by the depth of field choice.  I believe that good black and white photos have strong characteristics in contrast and texture, and this has both... excellent work :) = 10', '2003-09-23 16:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(427317, 38962, 9504, '<td valign="top">If only you had a little more depth of field in this photo...</td>', 'If only you had a little more depth of field in this photo...', '2003-09-23 16:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(427318, 38146, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good detail and nice exposure control - these things are harder than the look to capture effectively.</td>', 'Good detail and nice exposure control - these things are harder than the look to capture effectively.', '2003-09-23 16:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(427320, 38965, 9504, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t have enough light and so hence I believe the clarity is lacking.  The focus is too soft.  If the focus was crisp, you''d have a great shot here.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t have enough light and so hence I believe the clarity is lacking.  The focus is too soft.  If the focus was crisp, you''d have a great shot here.', '2003-09-23 16:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(427321, 38812, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice, effective shot - good use of colour, light and shape. Shame the middle ant isn''t a tad sharper, but this is nice.</td>', 'Nice, effective shot - good use of colour, light and shape. Shame the middle ant isn''t a tad sharper, but this is nice.', '2003-09-23 16:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(427323, 38247, 9504, '<td valign="top">The pink background takes away from the beauty of this flower.</td>', 'The pink background takes away from the beauty of this flower.', '2003-09-23 16:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(427325, 38857, 9504, '<td valign="top">What a STRANGE looking bug!!  Great title...</td>', 'What a STRANGE looking bug!!  Great title...', '2003-09-23 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(427328, 38425, 772, '<td valign="top">Life is all about time, unfortunately.  We spend our days working... our nights sleeping... (most of the time) and the few hours that we have left, we try to have some ''quality'' time alone or with ones we love.  The time displayed on your watch here and the dark mood of the photo reminds me that time is short...  We are approacing the ''eleventh hour'' :)  Excellent work... nice storytelling too... I hope my interpretation is similar in some way to your own :) = 10</td>', 'Life is all about time, unfortunately.  We spend our days working... our nights sleeping... (most of the time) and the few hours that we have left, we try to have some ''quality'' time alone or with ones we love.  The time displayed on your watch here and the dark mood of the photo reminds me that time is short...  We are approacing the ''eleventh hour'' :)  Excellent work... nice storytelling too... I hope my interpretation is similar in some way to your own :) = 10', '2003-09-23 16:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(427329, 38963, 9504, '<td valign="top">It\''s as if we are going to rub noses LOL!  EXCEPTIONAL, period. 10<br/></td>', 'It\''s as if we are going to rub noses LOL!  EXCEPTIONAL, period. 10', '2003-09-23 16:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(427332, 38665, 9504, '<td valign="top">Very awesome photo.  Solid 10.  Great job!</td>', 'Very awesome photo.  Solid 10.  Great job!', '2003-09-23 16:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(427333, 38721, 9504, '<td valign="top">I think the beauty of this iguana and the way you have showed him off in the photo with the clarity, color, angle and lighting -- makes this my favorite for the challenge.  I hope you win.  Solid 10 from me.</td>', 'I think the beauty of this iguana and the way you have showed him off in the photo with the clarity, color, angle and lighting -- makes this my favorite for the challenge.  I hope you win.  Solid 10 from me.', '2003-09-23 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(427335, 38438, 9504, '<td valign="top">I just love this photo.  It really speaks to me.  It is incredible -- the water, the bubbles, the bear!  You''ve got a 10 from me.</td>', 'I just love this photo.  It really speaks to me.  It is incredible -- the water, the bubbles, the bear!  You''ve got a 10 from me.', '2003-09-23 16:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(427338, 38725, 9504, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast.  It really shows the flower.  Definitely a high-ranker for this challenge -- predict in the top 10%.</td>', 'Excellent contrast.  It really shows the flower.  Definitely a high-ranker for this challenge -- predict in the top 10%.', '2003-09-23 16:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(427351, 38409, 7038, '<td valign="top">very good idea, im guessing you were told a bunch of other times about the date stamp on the picture.  Good compsition, a little bright on my monitor, but that could just be me. I wonder what it would look like if the snake wasnt falling off the side too much, but i gues you cant really do too much about it</td>', 'very good idea, im guessing you were told a bunch of other times about the date stamp on the picture.  Good compsition, a little bright on my monitor, but that could just be me. I wonder what it would look like if the snake wasnt falling off the side too much, but i gues you cant really do too much about it', '2003-09-23 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(427355, 38724, 7038, '<td valign="top">very nice idea.  just my opinion, but i think this may have worked better if the fall was going the other way, it would probably be easier to keep the foremost domino in better focus too, while the blur moved towards the closest one</td>', 'very nice idea.  just my opinion, but i think this may have worked better if the fall was going the other way, it would probably be easier to keep the foremost domino in better focus too, while the blur moved towards the closest one', '2003-09-23 16:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
