(427661, 37996, 11800, '<td valign="top">Well, after looking at several great images, I have decided to give you the 10.  Just wish I had the confidence to attempt such a light treatment.  You captured the softness of the petals and the essence of the light.</td>', 'Well, after looking at several great images, I have decided to give you the 10.  Just wish I had the confidence to attempt such a light treatment.  You captured the softness of the petals and the essence of the light.', '2003-09-24 00:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(427816, 38622, 12499, '<td valign="top">Powerful colours and contrast</td>', 'Powerful colours and contrast', '2003-09-24 02:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(427833, 38623, 7151, '<td valign="top">Woulda been really impressive if you coulda kept yourself out of the balls.  (...and I don''t mean that as a smart-ass comment.)  The ligting is great, and the balls stand out well - they just would have been more interesting if the markings weren''t obscured by the reflections.</td>', 'Woulda been really impressive if you coulda kept yourself out of the balls.  (...and I don''t mean that as a smart-ass comment.)  The ligting is great, and the balls stand out well - they just would have been more interesting if the markings weren''t obscured by the reflections.', '2003-09-24 02:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(427839, 38667, 7151, '<td valign="top">Would have worked better with the focus more towards the front of the shot.</td>', 'Would have worked better with the focus more towards the front of the shot.', '2003-09-24 02:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(427862, 38520, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors...Great focus...Love the composition...DOF is a touch shallow though.  Nicely original for this theme!!!  I say 7!<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome colors...Great focus...Love the composition...DOF is a touch shallow though.  Nicely original for this theme!!!  I say 7!TC', '2003-09-24 03:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(427866, 38800, 9906, '<td valign="top">Having a 10 year old boy I almost did a shot like this for this theme and also for sports.  I wasn''t gonna use so many toys (or are these D&amp;D figures) though.  This is a quite busy and the DOF is kinda shallow so my eye doesn''t have a resting point.  I can''t find a ''subject'' so to speak.  Also the large unfocused object in the foreground really is (IMHO) distracting....</td>', 'Having a 10 year old boy I almost did a shot like this for this theme and also for sports.  I wasn''t gonna use so many toys (or are these D&D figures) though.  This is a quite busy and the DOF is kinda shallow so my eye doesn''t have a resting point.  I can''t find a ''subject'' so to speak.  Also the large unfocused object in the foreground really is (IMHO) distracting....', '2003-09-24 03:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(427918, 38995, 12417, '<td valign="top">I felt the front flower was too out of focus considering it was so well defined by the light and that it detracted from rest of the image. I think the flowers in the back are great as well as the main flower!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-30 23:59:55.</i></td>', 'I felt the front flower was too out of focus considering it was so well defined by the light and that it detracted from rest of the image. I think the flowers in the back are great as well as the main flower!', '2003-09-24 04:58:45.000000', '2003-10-01 00:59:55.000000', 1),
(427921, 38001, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focusing. Love the shadows in the crevesses. You were able to capture some intrique details.</td>', 'Beautiful focusing. Love the shadows in the crevesses. You were able to capture some intrique details.', '2003-09-24 05:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(427922, 38897, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors make the flower pop out of the picture.Sharper details would hep you eyes on the flower. The graphic lighting help the composition stand out.</td>', 'Beautiful colors make the flower pop out of the picture.Sharper details would hep you eyes on the flower. The graphic lighting help the composition stand out.', '2003-09-24 05:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(427923, 38739, 10084, '<td valign="top">Need more sharpness in the picture to really make the subjects pop out of the picture.  The composition is fairly good and interesting.</td>', 'Need more sharpness in the picture to really make the subjects pop out of the picture.  The composition is fairly good and interesting.', '2003-09-24 05:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(427925, 38959, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very good details in the picture. With the beautiful shadows , reflections and the red hue it almost looks a bit like a rose petal. Lighting is extreme vivid and gives it an interesting mood.</td>', 'Very good details in the picture. With the beautiful shadows , reflections and the red hue it almost looks a bit like a rose petal. Lighting is extreme vivid and gives it an interesting mood.', '2003-09-24 05:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(427926, 38620, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue colors in the flower petals makes this image stand out. Would love to see more contrast in the picture. It would really help to make the water droplets come alive.</td>', 'Beautiful blue colors in the flower petals makes this image stand out. Would love to see more contrast in the picture. It would really help to make the water droplets come alive.', '2003-09-24 05:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(427928, 38477, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup of a penny. Would like to see a little bit more sharpness in the penny. Lighting is good. It helps to show some good shadows and reflections to lift the engraving out of the picture. Increasing sharpness may give texture of the copper.</td>', 'Nice closeup of a penny. Would like to see a little bit more sharpness in the penny. Lighting is good. It helps to show some good shadows and reflections to lift the engraving out of the picture. Increasing sharpness may give texture of the copper.', '2003-09-24 05:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(427929, 38895, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup. Great details in the hair. Lighting helps to bring the doll off the page. A different colored background may help pop it out even more.</td>', 'Nice closeup. Great details in the hair. Lighting helps to bring the doll off the page. A different colored background may help pop it out even more.', '2003-09-24 05:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(427931, 38686, 10084, '<td valign="top">More contrast would help the subject pop out of the shot. Maybe lighting just one side of the peach would help show off the roundedness of it. Some interesting colors on the background.</td>', 'More contrast would help the subject pop out of the shot. Maybe lighting just one side of the peach would help show off the roundedness of it. Some interesting colors on the background.', '2003-09-24 05:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(427932, 38670, 10084, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting on the flower. The shadows and the reflections in the flower really help to make it pop out of the shot. Incredible beautiful colors.</td>', 'Love the lighting on the flower. The shadows and the reflections in the flower really help to make it pop out of the shot. Incredible beautiful colors.', '2003-09-24 05:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(427935, 39008, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would like more contrast in the shot. This would help to make the shot really pop out. Making the blacks darker and the whites lighter would help to do this. I see some nice shadows that would be enhanced by doing this.</td>', 'Would like more contrast in the shot. This would help to make the shot really pop out. Making the blacks darker and the whites lighter would help to do this. I see some nice shadows that would be enhanced by doing this.', '2003-09-24 05:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(427938, 38881, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. The angle of the shot is very interesting. I would like more sharpness in the wooden figure in the foreground. I can see a bit of the carving marks but more contrast would really help them pop out of the image. Beautiful shadows on the side of the face.</td>', 'Very nice composition. The angle of the shot is very interesting. I would like more sharpness in the wooden figure in the foreground. I can see a bit of the carving marks but more contrast would really help them pop out of the image. Beautiful shadows on the side of the face.', '2003-09-24 05:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(427942, 38480, 10084, '<td valign="top">More sharpness would make the shot more interesting. The angle of the shot is fairly interesting, but needs more to keep your eyes looking at the shot. Maybe a brighter light coming from one direction would help give off a more vivid shadow on the table. I see a pretty good shadow there already, but it needs to be punched up a bit.</td>', 'More sharpness would make the shot more interesting. The angle of the shot is fairly interesting, but needs more to keep your eyes looking at the shot. Maybe a brighter light coming from one direction would help give off a more vivid shadow on the table. I see a pretty good shadow there already, but it needs to be punched up a bit.', '2003-09-24 06:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(427944, 38725, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful vivid colors. The lighting is perfect. The shadows and light reflections on the flower really help to make it pop out of the shot. The background also helps with this.</td>', 'Beautiful vivid colors. The lighting is perfect. The shadows and light reflections on the flower really help to make it pop out of the shot. The background also helps with this.', '2003-09-24 06:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(427952, 38865, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredible details in the shot.The reflections and the shadows really help to make the subject come alive. The great depth of field also helps with this. You can almost feel the fiber of the wood.<br/>Don''t care too much with the color of the frame. Maybe a solid black or just white might be a little better.</td>', 'Incredible details in the shot.The reflections and the shadows really help to make the subject come alive. The great depth of field also helps with this. You can almost feel the fiber of the wood.Don''t care too much with the color of the frame. Maybe a solid black or just white might be a little better.', '2003-09-24 06:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(427953, 38914, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sharpness in the needle and the thread. Great depth of field. Blurring of the thread really make for a interesting composition.</td>', 'Beautiful sharpness in the needle and the thread. Great depth of field. Blurring of the thread really make for a interesting composition.', '2003-09-24 06:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(427956, 38832, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Lighting is decent. I like how you were able to get the shine of the cream. The berries are a bit dark and you really can''t tell what they are until you read the title. They seem to bunch together and almost seems like a mass of berries instead of individual ones.</td>', 'Good composition. Lighting is decent. I like how you were able to get the shine of the cream. The berries are a bit dark and you really can''t tell what they are until you read the title. They seem to bunch together and almost seems like a mass of berries instead of individual ones.', '2003-09-24 06:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(427959, 38909, 778, '<td valign="top">Great use of the macro.  Balanced composition, great colors and solid focus!  Great work!</td>', 'Great use of the macro.  Balanced composition, great colors and solid focus!  Great work!', '2003-09-24 06:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(427964, 38967, 778, '<td valign="top">I love the photo...great use of color and balance.  I can accept it is a macro, but only because I figure it in the challenge...not something that jumps out as a macro!  Great work!</td>', 'I love the photo...great use of color and balance.  I can accept it is a macro, but only because I figure it in the challenge...not something that jumps out as a macro!  Great work!', '2003-09-24 06:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(427966, 38409, 778, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.  Great composition and lighting, maybe a touch more cropping (IMO).  The shadows help add depth!  Great job!</td>', 'Creative idea.  Great composition and lighting, maybe a touch more cropping (IMO).  The shadows help add depth!  Great job!', '2003-09-24 06:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(427967, 38338, 778, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot and very imaginative!  My only suggestion would have been to maybe have the tounge licking would have balanced it a bit more natural...but that is just my opinion.  I love the rich colors, the balance of the subjects and the lighting is great!</td>', 'Wonderful shot and very imaginative!  My only suggestion would have been to maybe have the tounge licking would have balanced it a bit more natural...but that is just my opinion.  I love the rich colors, the balance of the subjects and the lighting is great!', '2003-09-24 06:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
