(428479, 38924, 9906, '<td valign="top">Hey, I really like this one.  The textures are awesome.  Love the color. Nice focus on the zipper.  The DOF is just a touch shallow though, the close part IHMO should be in focus also...  Also it''s a touch blown out on the part of the cloth closest to lens.  I''m sayin'' 7<br/>TC</td>', 'Hey, I really like this one.  The textures are awesome.  Love the color. Nice focus on the zipper.  The DOF is just a touch shallow though, the close part IHMO should be in focus also...  Also it''s a touch blown out on the part of the cloth closest to lens.  I''m sayin'' 7TC', '2003-09-24 12:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(428484, 38396, 9906, '<td valign="top">I tried something like this at first and couldn''t get what I was looking for with my camera.  This is a tough shot.  I like the composition (but would have centered the plate and more offset the candles).  It''s blown out too much in the white part of the candles though.  (the flames of course should be a little blown out in this type of shot)  Also focus is a touch off.  (hard to do real good in this lighting!)  Adjusting for down for technical and adding bonus points for the attempt I gotta say 5<br/>TC</td>', 'I tried something like this at first and couldn''t get what I was looking for with my camera.  This is a tough shot.  I like the composition (but would have centered the plate and more offset the candles).  It''s blown out too much in the white part of the candles though.  (the flames of course should be a little blown out in this type of shot)  Also focus is a touch off.  (hard to do real good in this lighting!)  Adjusting for down for technical and adding bonus points for the attempt I gotta say 5TC', '2003-09-24 12:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(428501, 38914, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!!  Tough focus here.  You must have a nice camera!  It''s a little blown out on the pointy part of needle though.  Love the color and the way the thread kinda disappears into the background.  I''m sayin'' 8</td>', 'Very nice!!!  Tough focus here.  You must have a nice camera!  It''s a little blown out on the pointy part of needle though.  Love the color and the way the thread kinda disappears into the background.  I''m sayin'' 8', '2003-09-24 12:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(428502, 38721, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific shot - Composition, Lighting and Clarity are very good.  I think it could be slightly better cropped just a little tighter at the bottom, but now I''m picking.  Excellent work.</td>', 'This is a terrific shot - Composition, Lighting and Clarity are very good.  I think it could be slightly better cropped just a little tighter at the bottom, but now I''m picking.  Excellent work.', '2003-09-24 12:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(428507, 38955, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  I like the composition, position in the frame, lighting and clarity.  The detail in the wings and body is superb, right down to the antennae.  Nice work!  :-)</td>', 'Excellent shot!  I like the composition, position in the frame, lighting and clarity.  The detail in the wings and body is superb, right down to the antennae.  Nice work!  :-)', '2003-09-24 12:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(428510, 38351, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  I''d like to know how you accomplished this without the pushpin falling over  :-)  I like everything about this idea, I just wish the pencil point were a little clearer.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  I''d like to know how you accomplished this without the pushpin falling over  :-)  I like everything about this idea, I just wish the pencil point were a little clearer.', '2003-09-24 12:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(428513, 38859, 8125, '<td valign="top">Now this is a good idea, I wish I had thought of it.  Well done shot, I like the fruit skin ''fuzzies'' highlighted by the backlighting.  The different elements of the fruit are well captured.</td>', 'Now this is a good idea, I wish I had thought of it.  Well done shot, I like the fruit skin ''fuzzies'' highlighted by the backlighting.  The different elements of the fruit are well captured.', '2003-09-24 12:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(428516, 38425, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I like the reflections, use of b&amp;w, composition, lighting....  nicely done!  I wonder what a solid background might have done for this shot (either black or white).  Now I''m being picky  :-)</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I like the reflections, use of b&w, composition, lighting....  nicely done!  I wonder what a solid background might have done for this shot (either black or white).  Now I''m being picky  :-)', '2003-09-24 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(428518, 38733, 8125, '<td valign="top">With the lighting vs. shadows and the bud being so small compared to the leaves and flower, your subject gets lost in the image.  I found myself looking all over the photo to find the bud.</td>', 'With the lighting vs. shadows and the bud being so small compared to the leaves and flower, your subject gets lost in the image.  I found myself looking all over the photo to find the bud.', '2003-09-24 13:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(428520, 38134, 8125, '<td valign="top">The bubbles in this shot are excellent, the blue is very clear.  The title lends me to believe that the lemon is the main subject and I don''t see that represented well.</td>', 'The bubbles in this shot are excellent, the blue is very clear.  The title lends me to believe that the lemon is the main subject and I don''t see that represented well.', '2003-09-24 13:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(428525, 38406, 6870, '<td valign="top">Bizarre shot; Abstract and weird and engaging. Nice work. 9</td>', 'Bizarre shot; Abstract and weird and engaging. Nice work. 9', '2003-09-24 13:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(428526, 38853, 6870, '<td valign="top">Radical use of DOF; works for me!</td>', 'Radical use of DOF; works for me!', '2003-09-24 13:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(428531, 38975, 6870, '<td valign="top">Got fish? I like. Lighting is wonderful. Nice catch!</td>', 'Got fish? I like. Lighting is wonderful. Nice catch!', '2003-09-24 13:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(428532, 37996, 6870, '<td valign="top">Creative use of soft focus and high key. Nifty! Add a lot of artistic interpretation to the flower. 9</td>', 'Creative use of soft focus and high key. Nifty! Add a lot of artistic interpretation to the flower. 9', '2003-09-24 13:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(428534, 38188, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition with the randomness of the candies. Slightly out of focus, but nice work.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition with the randomness of the candies. Slightly out of focus, but nice work.', '2003-09-24 13:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(428536, 38782, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the abstractness of this shot. Interesting subject and unique and engaging.</td>', 'I like the abstractness of this shot. Interesting subject and unique and engaging.', '2003-09-24 13:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(428540, 38352, 6870, '<td valign="top">Engaging abstract. the random shapes and light and lines work for me. My attn keeps going to that one leaf in the center; is that what you want?</td>', 'Engaging abstract. the random shapes and light and lines work for me. My attn keeps going to that one leaf in the center; is that what you want?', '2003-09-24 13:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(428545, 38897, 6870, '<td valign="top">The flower is a bit out of focus, but I like the diagonal light/lines, which creates a lot of interest here.</td>', 'The flower is a bit out of focus, but I like the diagonal light/lines, which creates a lot of interest here.', '2003-09-24 13:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(428546, 38678, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous mood and lighting! 9</td>', 'Marvelous mood and lighting! 9', '2003-09-24 13:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(428547, 38895, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever and goofy and well done.</td>', 'Clever and goofy and well done.', '2003-09-24 13:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(428551, 38962, 6870, '<td valign="top">He''s a cutie! DOF may be a bit tight, as  it would sure me nice to get his eyes in sharp focus. i like the very misty feel to this shot.</td>', 'He''s a cutie! DOF may be a bit tight, as  it would sure me nice to get his eyes in sharp focus. i like the very misty feel to this shot.', '2003-09-24 13:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(428552, 38476, 6870, '<td valign="top">I am your Father! NOooooooooooo! NIcely menacing and good clarity!</td>', 'I am your Father! NOooooooooooo! NIcely menacing and good clarity!', '2003-09-24 13:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(428554, 38792, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIcely simple. Simply nice. 9</td>', 'NIcely simple. Simply nice. 9', '2003-09-24 13:23:36.000000', NULL, 1);
