(428859, 38620, 173, '<td valign="top">Looks like the color is a little washed out throughout the photo. The photo may have looked better in black and white, that way the hue issues would go away. Then if you messed with the levels you could have added a cool mono black and white look to the photo. Anyway, for what it''s worth still a nice photo.</td>', 'Looks like the color is a little washed out throughout the photo. The photo may have looked better in black and white, that way the hue issues would go away. Then if you messed with the levels you could have added a cool mono black and white look to the photo. Anyway, for what it''s worth still a nice photo.', '2003-09-24 15:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(428888, 39002, 10883, '<td valign="top">The pic could have been cropped a bit more, and the snail is overexposed, it loses a lot of detail at the front.</td>', 'The pic could have been cropped a bit more, and the snail is overexposed, it loses a lot of detail at the front.', '2003-09-24 16:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(428900, 38449, 9504, '<td valign="top">What exceptional clarity! I feel like I am right there!  8<br/></td>', 'What exceptional clarity! I feel like I am right there!  8', '2003-09-24 16:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(428905, 38451, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice timing!</td>', 'Nice timing!', '2003-09-24 16:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
