(429430, 37996, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus shot, but I think it needs more contrast against the background, then again, I seem to prefer color over B&amp;W, though I try hard to not score that way.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice soft focus shot, but I think it needs more contrast against the background, then again, I seem to prefer color over B&W, though I try hard to not score that way.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-24 20:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
