(429486, 38754, 10402, '<td valign="top">There is enough detail on the smooth object to see that it is perfectly focused, in contrast to the rough material. This parallels the contrast between rough and smooth that is the subject of the photo, adding depth to the meaning of the image. Well done.</td>', 'There is enough detail on the smooth object to see that it is perfectly focused, in contrast to the rough material. This parallels the contrast between rough and smooth that is the subject of the photo, adding depth to the meaning of the image. Well done.', '2003-09-24 21:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(429628, 38951, 8522, '<td valign="top">Hmm, Google language tools tells me this means ''The rubber Art to cancel'' from Italian to English. Not speaking any Italian, this has me completely baffled. Interesting shot though, although I don''t like the noise levels (which could have been helped with NeatImage), and the shadows. The shadows don''t look clear enough to be deliberate, so it''s difficult to tell what kind of lighting effect you were after. I think your title is something along the lines of creating art from rubber erasers, and I''m not sure art is really what has been created here. 6</td>', 'Hmm, Google language tools tells me this means ''The rubber Art to cancel'' from Italian to English. Not speaking any Italian, this has me completely baffled. Interesting shot though, although I don''t like the noise levels (which could have been helped with NeatImage), and the shadows. The shadows don''t look clear enough to be deliberate, so it''s difficult to tell what kind of lighting effect you were after. I think your title is something along the lines of creating art from rubber erasers, and I''m not sure art is really what has been created here. 6', '2003-09-24 23:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(429644, 38458, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, but a bit washed out; it needs a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Nice focus, but a bit washed out; it needs a bit more contrast.', '2003-09-24 23:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
