(429859, 38298, 9073, '<td valign="top">Very strong effect achieved here. Very clear. Maybe a few too many hot spots and the band being directly behind the watch face disturbs the clarity. However, you might argue that the dof achieved is worth it.</td>', 'Very strong effect achieved here. Very clear. Maybe a few too many hot spots and the band being directly behind the watch face disturbs the clarity. However, you might argue that the dof achieved is worth it.', '2003-09-25 01:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(429861, 38592, 9073, '<td valign="top">Bad joke here.</td>', 'Bad joke here.', '2003-09-25 01:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(429866, 38967, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like this shot for its simplicity and direct appeal. 2 negative points. 1) the shadows to the left of each mint are weak and 2) there''s a disturbing crease on the right border between the bottom two mints. I think that this image might look better if flattened. That is, the feeling of perspective removed by opening the f-stop, increasing the shutter speed, and taking the shot from a higher position before cropping.</td>', 'I like this shot for its simplicity and direct appeal. 2 negative points. 1) the shadows to the left of each mint are weak and 2) there''s a disturbing crease on the right border between the bottom two mints. I think that this image might look better if flattened. That is, the feeling of perspective removed by opening the f-stop, increasing the shutter speed, and taking the shot from a higher position before cropping.', '2003-09-25 01:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(429870, 38352, 9073, '<td valign="top">I can see your point here, but I feel that the actual subject has to be more interesting.</td>', 'I can see your point here, but I feel that the actual subject has to be more interesting.', '2003-09-25 01:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
