(429906, 38991, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections and shadows in the shot really help to bring out the details. I like the lighting that you chose for the piece. Great depth of field help to make the ridges pop out of the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections and shadows in the shot really help to bring out the details. I like the lighting that you chose for the piece. Great depth of field help to make the ridges pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-25 02:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
