(429955, 38876, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful closeup of a beach scene. The beautiful lighting and shadows really make the shells pop out of the pictue. Love the ridges on them. The texture on the ant helps to make it look alive. Great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful closeup of a beach scene. The beautiful lighting and shadows really make the shells pop out of the pictue. Love the ridges on them. The texture on the ant helps to make it look alive. Great shot.', '2003-09-25 04:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(429956, 38449, 8522, '<td valign="top">The crop is just a little too close for my taste here, and it looks oversharpened. There are some burnt out highlights in the eyes, and I don''t like the shadow cast behind the cat.<br/>Other than that, I think this is fabulous! Great character and expression captured in this shot, I''m not sure I''d have wanted to be this near a cat baring it''s fangs. 7</td>', 'The crop is just a little too close for my taste here, and it looks oversharpened. There are some burnt out highlights in the eyes, and I don''t like the shadow cast behind the cat.Other than that, I think this is fabulous! Great character and expression captured in this shot, I''m not sure I''d have wanted to be this near a cat baring it''s fangs. 7', '2003-09-25 04:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(429959, 38665, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful closeup. Love the texture of the eyes. I can''t believe that you were able to get close enough to capture pollen on the bees'' body. Great depth of field help to make the head pop out of the shot.<br/> <br/>I think that the frame distracts a bit. Maybe a different colored one might work better or none.</td>', 'Beautiful closeup. Love the texture of the eyes. I can''t believe that you were able to get close enough to capture pollen on the bees'' body. Great depth of field help to make the head pop out of the shot. I think that the frame distracts a bit. Maybe a different colored one might work better or none.', '2003-09-25 04:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(429961, 38773, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very cool pose. Love the great depth of field it help to make the scene come alive. Great details can be seen the bee.</td>', 'Very cool pose. Love the great depth of field it help to make the scene come alive. Great details can be seen the bee.', '2003-09-25 04:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
