(430159, 38793, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice macro! I like that you were able to capture both the spider and the web in good focus, and that the background is nicely out of focus AND has pleasing colors in it. Also, the composition is working quite well, I think.</td>', 'Nice macro! I like that you were able to capture both the spider and the web in good focus, and that the background is nicely out of focus AND has pleasing colors in it. Also, the composition is working quite well, I think.', '2003-09-25 10:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
