(430170, 38856, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. This one is something of a sleeper, I''m afraid. It really doesnt look like much in the thumbnail, but it sure does shine when viewed full size. Great color, clarity, and composition.</td>', 'Nice photo. This one is something of a sleeper, I''m afraid. It really doesnt look like much in the thumbnail, but it sure does shine when viewed full size. Great color, clarity, and composition.', '2003-09-25 10:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
