(430209, 38278, 2667, '<td valign="top">Well Ursala, I guess we know this is yours now :)  When I first checked DPContest this morning I thought, Oh, they forgot to change the macro abstract... the judges must have goofed the voting. Then I realized it was yours and I had seen it here.  It is a great macro photo.  I like the compositon and the way the shadows do the crisscross on the egg. Very cool. Congrats!</td>', 'Well Ursala, I guess we know this is yours now :)  When I first checked DPContest this morning I thought, Oh, they forgot to change the macro abstract... the judges must have goofed the voting. Then I realized it was yours and I had seen it here.  It is a great macro photo.  I like the compositon and the way the shadows do the crisscross on the egg. Very cool. Congrats!', '2003-09-25 11:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(430238, 38871, 2667, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. The colors and composition are great! The slight blowout on her face is a bit distracting, but still, its very nice.</td>', 'Cool photo. The colors and composition are great! The slight blowout on her face is a bit distracting, but still, its very nice.', '2003-09-25 11:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
