(430876, 38877, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but please "add more" to make it your own art (this is basically a very nice shot of Other People''s Art, see site rules).  Glare is a bit harsh on the far side of the face.  Color and focus are very good.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, but please "add more" to make it your own art (this is basically a very nice shot of Other People''s Art, see site rules).  Glare is a bit harsh on the far side of the face.  Color and focus are very good.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-25 20:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(430883, 37882, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot....this orchid might "catch flies", but it''s not a venus fly trap (no score, just being flower "picky").  Good color and focus.  Maybe a touch too much flash.  You might also consider washing the white stains off the leaves for more appeal.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot....this orchid might "catch flies", but it''s not a venus fly trap (no score, just being flower "picky").  Good color and focus.  Maybe a touch too much flash.  You might also consider washing the white stains off the leaves for more appeal.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-25 20:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(430888, 38812, 1005, '<td valign="top">Coolly abstract!  Nice shot.  I can''t see this scoring well, but I like it.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Coolly abstract!  Nice shot.  I can''t see this scoring well, but I like it.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-25 20:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(430895, 39000, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro.  I''m pretty sure the face is a picture, and that''s O.K., but it''s too small and looks slightly grainy.  I like the idea, but size matters.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting macro.  I''m pretty sure the face is a picture, and that''s O.K., but it''s too small and looks slightly grainy.  I like the idea, but size matters.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-25 20:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(430897, 38109, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  I''m sure you''re right and this is a mousetrap, but there''s such a thing as too close?  (W/O the title, I would have NEVER guessed)  Seems like too much saturation as well, makes for cool colors, but increases the grain, too.  <br/>6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very colorful.  I''m sure you''re right and this is a mousetrap, but there''s such a thing as too close?  (W/O the title, I would have NEVER guessed)  Seems like too much saturation as well, makes for cool colors, but increases the grain, too.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-25 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(430903, 38968, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear and nice color.  Interest level is moderate, the angle is a good idea, but sliced off the star.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very clear and nice color.  Interest level is moderate, the angle is a good idea, but sliced off the star.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-25 20:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(430906, 38734, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, lovely texures and lighting, spoilt a little for me by the chaotic composition. It''s not clear what the viewer is to focus on, and there are too many elements leading the eye about. 6</td>', 'Beautiful colours, lovely texures and lighting, spoilt a little for me by the chaotic composition. It''s not clear what the viewer is to focus on, and there are too many elements leading the eye about. 6', '2003-09-25 20:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(430909, 38976, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting light and colour, but the comosition seems poorly weighted. I think rule of thirds could have been your ally here. I feel there''s too much negative space at the top, and the subject is too horizontally centred. Interesting choice of subject though, great textures. 6</td>', 'Interesting light and colour, but the comosition seems poorly weighted. I think rule of thirds could have been your ally here. I feel there''s too much negative space at the top, and the subject is too horizontally centred. Interesting choice of subject though, great textures. 6', '2003-09-25 20:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(430914, 38257, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, ooppps, camera shadow..need to watch that (I do it all the time, next!)  Lovely color, focus is pretty darn sharp (not exact across the entire flower, but mostly good.  Nice water drops (natural or added? just curious).  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice shot, ooppps, camera shadow..need to watch that (I do it all the time, next!)  Lovely color, focus is pretty darn sharp (not exact across the entire flower, but mostly good.  Nice water drops (natural or added? just curious).  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-25 20:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(430916, 38628, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, great close-up, lovely colours and textures. I think that your intention was to have the subject centred, but the eye naturally wants to focus on the eyes first, so I feel that you should have placed the eyes in the centre of the frame. I''m sure NeatImage could have helped you remove a lot of the noise in your background. I could be wrong here, but it looks like you used a large radius in your sharpening. It''s better to go for a radius &lt; 0.5 and a sharpening amount of around 100. Score: 7</td>', 'Interesting shot, great close-up, lovely colours and textures. I think that your intention was to have the subject centred, but the eye naturally wants to focus on the eyes first, so I feel that you should have placed the eyes in the centre of the frame. I''m sure NeatImage could have helped you remove a lot of the noise in your background. I could be wrong here, but it looks like you used a large radius in your sharpening. It''s better to go for a radius < 0.5 and a sharpening amount of around 100. Score: 7', '2003-09-25 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(430918, 38774, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice macro...I like the texture in this shot....good color</td>', 'nice macro...I like the texture in this shot....good color', '2003-09-25 20:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(430922, 38146, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured (Thanks for giving the artist credit!)  Except for the glare, I don''t see much that YOU added to make this art your own (see site rules on Other People''s Art - I don''t agree with the masses that this rule only counts with flat art)  Solid focus, clear background.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nicely captured (Thanks for giving the artist credit!)  Except for the glare, I don''t see much that YOU added to make this art your own (see site rules on Other People''s Art - I don''t agree with the masses that this rule only counts with flat art)  Solid focus, clear background.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-25 20:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(430925, 38005, 10402, '<td valign="top">This photo shows the details very well. I like the composition.</td>', 'This photo shows the details very well. I like the composition.', '2003-09-25 20:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(430930, 38951, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice color selections, pretty clear photo, I like the idea you went with here....</td>', 'nice color selections, pretty clear photo, I like the idea you went with here....', '2003-09-25 20:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(430934, 38257, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice photo, I like the droplets, they show up clearly...</td>', 'nice photo, I like the droplets, they show up clearly...', '2003-09-25 20:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(430941, 38409, 8522, '<td valign="top">I hope you''re going to turn off the date function in your camera for the next one... Interesting photo, I love how you''ve got the nackground burnt out. Interesting crop, works well here in my opinion. Think it could do with some significant sharpening to bring out the textures in the snake. Shame about the high levels of glare on top of the apple. Score: 6, but these issues could have raised the score easily if fixed.</td>', 'I hope you''re going to turn off the date function in your camera for the next one... Interesting photo, I love how you''ve got the nackground burnt out. Interesting crop, works well here in my opinion. Think it could do with some significant sharpening to bring out the textures in the snake. Shame about the high levels of glare on top of the apple. Score: 6, but these issues could have raised the score easily if fixed.', '2003-09-25 20:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(430950, 38963, 8522, '<td valign="top">For heaven''s sakes! I have got to get a digital slr and lenses just so I can take macros like these. It''s not all just in the equipment though (but it helps!), as you have a VERY well taken shot here, much harder than it looks I suspect. Bit too much glare and noise for me to give above 8. Shame the background isn''t more black. Did you try NeatImage? 8</td>', 'For heaven''s sakes! I have got to get a digital slr and lenses just so I can take macros like these. It''s not all just in the equipment though (but it helps!), as you have a VERY well taken shot here, much harder than it looks I suspect. Bit too much glare and noise for me to give above 8. Shame the background isn''t more black. Did you try NeatImage? 8', '2003-09-25 20:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(430959, 38975, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting critter. I like the composition. I think it would look better without the yellowish color cast, but it''s hard to tell; it adds some warmth to the image.</td>', 'Interesting critter. I like the composition. I think it would look better without the yellowish color cast, but it''s hard to tell; it adds some warmth to the image.', '2003-09-25 21:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(430966, 38878, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, well composed, good focus.</td>', 'Interesting subject, well composed, good focus.', '2003-09-25 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(430969, 38856, 8522, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this shot, the autumnal colours of the leaf look great against the desaturated water. The border works well here, and complements the photo nicely. I personally wish that the leaf was composed diagonally across the frame... maybe from top left to bottom right. There''s something about the top-down composition that bothers me. 8</td>', 'I LOVE this shot, the autumnal colours of the leaf look great against the desaturated water. The border works well here, and complements the photo nicely. I personally wish that the leaf was composed diagonally across the frame... maybe from top left to bottom right. There''s something about the top-down composition that bothers me. 8', '2003-09-25 21:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(430970, 38909, 9441, '<td valign="top">awesome photo...I love the way you captured the ''spritz'' so beautifully....very cool, and so clear!</td>', 'awesome photo...I love the way you captured the ''spritz'' so beautifully....very cool, and so clear!', '2003-09-25 21:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(430972, 39005, 10402, '<td valign="top">The fly is almost invisible; nice surprise for those who take the time to look.</td>', 'The fly is almost invisible; nice surprise for those who take the time to look.', '2003-09-25 21:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(430973, 38800, 9441, '<td valign="top">not sure I like the blur in the foreground, but the figurine itself looks pretty sharp...</td>', 'not sure I like the blur in the foreground, but the figurine itself looks pretty sharp...', '2003-09-25 21:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(430974, 38655, 9441, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF, the colors are a good choice for contrast....</td>', 'I like the DOF, the colors are a good choice for contrast....', '2003-09-25 21:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(430975, 38998, 9441, '<td valign="top">lovely macro, I love the subject matter, and the colors are wonderful, I like the angle and the DOF is good.</td>', 'lovely macro, I love the subject matter, and the colors are wonderful, I like the angle and the DOF is good.', '2003-09-25 21:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(430976, 38760, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb idea, great combination of colours, wonderful composition. I feel that your lighting let you down here though, the shadow on the yellow lets it down a little, and the green is a bit dull. Little bits of glare are very noticable in a shot like this. Very nice though, and I look forward to seeing what you can do with better lighting, as you obviously have a good eye. 7</td>', 'Superb idea, great combination of colours, wonderful composition. I feel that your lighting let you down here though, the shadow on the yellow lets it down a little, and the green is a bit dull. Little bits of glare are very noticable in a shot like this. Very nice though, and I look forward to seeing what you can do with better lighting, as you obviously have a good eye. 7', '2003-09-25 21:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(430978, 38088, 9441, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture and ''feel'' of this photo...nice background for this shot, good angle, great subject choice...</td>', 'I really like the texture and ''feel'' of this photo...nice background for this shot, good angle, great subject choice...', '2003-09-25 21:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(430980, 38438, 9441, '<td valign="top">cool underwater photo!  so this is how they look underwater...very neat!  I love all the bubbles...</td>', 'cool underwater photo!  so this is how they look underwater...very neat!  I love all the bubbles...', '2003-09-25 21:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(430981, 38458, 9441, '<td valign="top">a bit grainy and overexposed for me..good subject choice, just needs to be a little sharper and clearer....</td>', 'a bit grainy and overexposed for me..good subject choice, just needs to be a little sharper and clearer....', '2003-09-25 21:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(430982, 38969, 8522, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, insect shots where the subject takes up a significant portion of the frame, and the subject is centred tend not to work. This is because a viewer will want to focus on the eyes first, but the photographer has made an arbitrary centre of the insect''s body the focus. The butterfly is also too centred vertically, I think it would have been much stronger if you had cropped a significant portion of the top off. Very nice butterfly macro other than that, shame that your background is a little distracting just above the butterfly. Great light, good detail. Shame about the glare on the foreground flowers. 7</td>', 'In my opinion, insect shots where the subject takes up a significant portion of the frame, and the subject is centred tend not to work. This is because a viewer will want to focus on the eyes first, but the photographer has made an arbitrary centre of the insect''s body the focus. The butterfly is also too centred vertically, I think it would have been much stronger if you had cropped a significant portion of the top off. Very nice butterfly macro other than that, shame that your background is a little distracting just above the butterfly. Great light, good detail. Shame about the glare on the foreground flowers. 7', '2003-09-25 21:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(430984, 38900, 9441, '<td valign="top">this would''ve been a fabulous photo except for the glare that showed up in the eye....still is a nice closeup shot!</td>', 'this would''ve been a fabulous photo except for the glare that showed up in the eye....still is a nice closeup shot!', '2003-09-25 21:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(430986, 38958, 9441, '<td valign="top">I like the delicate detail about this photo...the color looks nice, and the water droplets add interest.</td>', 'I like the delicate detail about this photo...the color looks nice, and the water droplets add interest.', '2003-09-25 21:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(430989, 38399, 9441, '<td valign="top">funny photo!  very creative....nice closeup and lots of texture make this a cool shot.</td>', 'funny photo!  very creative....nice closeup and lots of texture make this a cool shot.', '2003-09-25 21:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(430991, 38967, 8522, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb, great idea, very well executed. Very effective lighting. Great composition. I really think NeatImage could have improved this for me though, I can''t decide if I''m seeing noise or texture, so I''d have been temped to smooth it all out. 9</td>', 'Absolutely superb, great idea, very well executed. Very effective lighting. Great composition. I really think NeatImage could have improved this for me though, I can''t decide if I''m seeing noise or texture, so I''d have been temped to smooth it all out. 9', '2003-09-25 21:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(430993, 38642, 9441, '<td valign="top">cute ideal...I like the title....nice macro</td>', 'cute ideal...I like the title....nice macro', '2003-09-25 21:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(430994, 38643, 9441, '<td valign="top">good photo...I like the color selections you went with....</td>', 'good photo...I like the color selections you went with....', '2003-09-25 21:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(430998, 38726, 9441, '<td valign="top">Really great macro shot!  I love all the colors, the bee looks wonderful and the pollen you captured on him is great!  I give a 10 to this</td>', 'Really great macro shot!  I love all the colors, the bee looks wonderful and the pollen you captured on him is great!  I give a 10 to this', '2003-09-25 21:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(430999, 38757, 9441, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, I like the shadow created by the pod.</td>', 'interesting photo, I like the shadow created by the pod.', '2003-09-25 21:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(431000, 38721, 10402, '<td valign="top">This really shows off the shapes of the scales and the textures they form. But the lines of the jowl and leg lead my eye to the fuzzy dark spot behind the dewlap, drawing attention away from the interesting face. A little more space above and in front of the iguana would open it up and help the natural lines draw attention to where you really want it.</td>', 'This really shows off the shapes of the scales and the textures they form. But the lines of the jowl and leg lead my eye to the fuzzy dark spot behind the dewlap, drawing attention away from the interesting face. A little more space above and in front of the iguana would open it up and help the natural lines draw attention to where you really want it.', '2003-09-25 21:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(431005, 37864, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great expression, shame about the burnt out highlights. Background looks like it has some bad artifacting left behind by NeatImage. The sharpening''s gone a bit wrong, perhaps the radius was too wide. I think a closer crop could have made this a stronger image. 6</td>', 'Great expression, shame about the burnt out highlights. Background looks like it has some bad artifacting left behind by NeatImage. The sharpening''s gone a bit wrong, perhaps the radius was too wide. I think a closer crop could have made this a stronger image. 6', '2003-09-25 22:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(431014, 38620, 11406, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2003-09-25 22:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(431017, 37996, 11406, '<td valign="top">simply elegant</td>', 'simply elegant', '2003-09-25 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(431032, 38859, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful closeup, I like the way the light comes through...good color, good texture, good detailed shot!</td>', 'wonderful closeup, I like the way the light comes through...good color, good texture, good detailed shot!', '2003-09-25 22:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(431034, 38935, 9441, '<td valign="top">very good photo...I like the angle</td>', 'very good photo...I like the angle', '2003-09-25 22:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(431045, 37882, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice macro, I like this...slight glare spots, but still a great shot...</td>', 'nice macro, I like this...slight glare spots, but still a great shot...', '2003-09-25 22:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(431048, 38283, 10263, '<td valign="top">My guess is that he''s either dead or fake.. the pose isn''t quite right. Nice setup though.</td>', 'My guess is that he''s either dead or fake.. the pose isn''t quite right. Nice setup though.', '2003-09-25 22:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(431088, 38726, 2649, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  Great detail &amp; colors.</td>', 'Nice macro.  Great detail & colors.', '2003-09-25 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(431110, 38827, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice mushroom picture. I like how you were able to capture the dimples on the red head of the ''room. Some subtle shadows in there. The bright red color brings it out of the shot.  I think a tiny bit more of contrast or levels would really help bring it up a notch.<br/> <br/>The framing is nice. Not distracting at all. Good color choice.</td>', 'Nice mushroom picture. I like how you were able to capture the dimples on the red head of the ''room. Some subtle shadows in there. The bright red color brings it out of the shot.  I think a tiny bit more of contrast or levels would really help bring it up a notch. The framing is nice. Not distracting at all. Good color choice.', '2003-09-26 00:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(431112, 38406, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Would like to see a close look at the nail. Nails really have beautiful details if you get close enough. I like how you lit the nail. Bright lights on one side , dark , and then the reflection of the light.<br/>The red light makes it look like a candle or match. The frame actual distracts. Try a white, black , or no frame.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Would like to see a close look at the nail. Nails really have beautiful details if you get close enough. I like how you lit the nail. Bright lights on one side , dark , and then the reflection of the light.The red light makes it look like a candle or match. The frame actual distracts. Try a white, black , or no frame.', '2003-09-26 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(431121, 38773, 12585, '<td valign="top">gr8 shot, nice focus &amp; stretch ;p<br/></td>', 'gr8 shot, nice focus & stretch ;p', '2003-09-26 00:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(431125, 38812, 8522, '<td valign="top">So many great photos this challenge, I''ve given out the most 10s in any challenge I think, and THIS is my favourite :-)<br/>Great colours, composition, textures, light, etc.<br/>What makes this stand out to me is the ability of a macro to take us to another universe within our own, and this photo certainly does that by bringing us down to an ant''s level. At this stage, we can almost empathise with them in this cosy environment. There''s something strangely alien about them, as if they were about to step out of Spielberg''s spaceship in Close Encounters. Great shot! 10</td>', 'So many great photos this challenge, I''ve given out the most 10s in any challenge I think, and THIS is my favourite :-)Great colours, composition, textures, light, etc.What makes this stand out to me is the ability of a macro to take us to another universe within our own, and this photo certainly does that by bringing us down to an ant''s level. At this stage, we can almost empathise with them in this cosy environment. There''s something strangely alien about them, as if they were about to step out of Spielberg''s spaceship in Close Encounters. Great shot! 10', '2003-09-26 00:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(431128, 38425, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, superb use of light and shadow, here creating a ''noir'' look. Use of blinds and an old pocket watch, along with high contrast and much sharpness have worked well in creating this feel. Brilliant composition. My only criticism is that you need a model with better looking fingernails. 10</td>', 'Fantastic, superb use of light and shadow, here creating a ''noir'' look. Use of blinds and an old pocket watch, along with high contrast and much sharpness have worked well in creating this feel. Brilliant composition. My only criticism is that you need a model with better looking fingernails. 10', '2003-09-26 00:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(431132, 38955, 8522, '<td valign="top">Good use of b&amp;w here, risky when shooting colourful insects. Here it is used to enhance the mood of a butterfly down on it''s luck. I like the way the eye is lead to the top-right of the frame, enhancing the idea that the subject is not ready to fly off yet. Effective crop, great textures, good sharpness. 10</td>', 'Good use of b&w here, risky when shooting colourful insects. Here it is used to enhance the mood of a butterfly down on it''s luck. I like the way the eye is lead to the top-right of the frame, enhancing the idea that the subject is not ready to fly off yet. Effective crop, great textures, good sharpness. 10', '2003-09-26 00:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(431133, 38670, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower macro, masterly use of colour, light and texture. The composition is unusual, but works nicely. Great range of tones, from the highlights at the bottom to the shadows at top right. Detail is kept throughout the tonal range. Just the right amount of blur. Lovely. 10</td>', 'Beautiful flower macro, masterly use of colour, light and texture. The composition is unusual, but works nicely. Great range of tones, from the highlights at the bottom to the shadows at top right. Detail is kept throughout the tonal range. Just the right amount of blur. Lovely. 10', '2003-09-26 00:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(431135, 38665, 8522, '<td valign="top">Woah, I want a camera and lenses that can give me a shot like this!  Well taken shot, the light is perfect which is quite unusual for macros of this nature. Superb composition/ crop. You seem to have posed your subject very nicely. The level of detail is just unbelievable. Amazing dof. 10</td>', 'Woah, I want a camera and lenses that can give me a shot like this!  Well taken shot, the light is perfect which is quite unusual for macros of this nature. Superb composition/ crop. You seem to have posed your subject very nicely. The level of detail is just unbelievable. Amazing dof. 10', '2003-09-26 00:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(431137, 37996, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice high key shot, soft focus works really well. Effective use of b&amp;w. 10</td>', 'Very nice high key shot, soft focus works really well. Effective use of b&w. 10', '2003-09-26 00:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(431139, 38982, 8522, '<td valign="top">An unusual shot, but very effective. I like the way you took an everyday object to give a sense of scale, and grab our attention. Not just another insect macro!<br/>Great lighting, good composition, nice level of detail.<br/>Perhaps you could have straightened the horizontal line of the toothbrush? 10</td>', 'An unusual shot, but very effective. I like the way you took an everyday object to give a sense of scale, and grab our attention. Not just another insect macro!Great lighting, good composition, nice level of detail.Perhaps you could have straightened the horizontal line of the toothbrush? 10', '2003-09-26 00:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(431142, 38278, 8522, '<td valign="top">This gave me a chuckle, very inventive! Great use of shadow and light, I''m a sucker for shadow becoming a strong element of the composition. Good use of tonal contrasts... in fact this shot is really a study in all sorts of contrasts from the nurturing element of the egg v. the violence of the whisk to the contrast of straight lines v. round forms, and so on.<br/>The elements in the frame are balanced well, the crop is perfect. Nice one! 10</td>', 'This gave me a chuckle, very inventive! Great use of shadow and light, I''m a sucker for shadow becoming a strong element of the composition. Good use of tonal contrasts... in fact this shot is really a study in all sorts of contrasts from the nurturing element of the egg v. the violence of the whisk to the contrast of straight lines v. round forms, and so on.The elements in the frame are balanced well, the crop is perfect. Nice one! 10', '2003-09-26 00:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(431154, 38283, 8522, '<td valign="top">Amazing level of detail, great lighting. I like the blue reflections off the body of the fly. Is he dead? Good use of a prop to show the scale of what we''re seeing. Great background. Very professional. 10</td>', 'Amazing level of detail, great lighting. I like the blue reflections off the body of the fly. Is he dead? Good use of a prop to show the scale of what we''re seeing. Great background. Very professional. 10', '2003-09-26 00:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(431155, 38741, 8522, '<td valign="top">Incredible use of dof here, the blue blur looks almost painted. Great use of texture. Very effective background. I guess I just don''t find the subject that inspiring though. 9</td>', 'Incredible use of dof here, the blue blur looks almost painted. Great use of texture. Very effective background. I guess I just don''t find the subject that inspiring though. 9', '2003-09-26 01:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(431157, 38407, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, it makes me want to have a crack at doing a similar one. Great lighting/ flash use. The motion trails are great. 9</td>', 'I love this shot, it makes me want to have a crack at doing a similar one. Great lighting/ flash use. The motion trails are great. 9', '2003-09-26 01:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(431159, 38725, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good lighting. Very effective background. A bit too simple here though, I feel that the composition is lacking something... 9</td>', 'Very nice, good lighting. Very effective background. A bit too simple here though, I feel that the composition is lacking something... 9', '2003-09-26 01:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(431161, 38971, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, delicious use of colours and textures here. Great background. I''d love to know the setup behind this shot. The heart-shaped strawberry was a lovely idea. Not 100% sure about the composition though. 9</td>', 'Wow, delicious use of colours and textures here. Great background. I''d love to know the setup behind this shot. The heart-shaped strawberry was a lovely idea. Not 100% sure about the composition though. 9', '2003-09-26 01:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(431162, 38995, 8522, '<td valign="top">A beautiful composition. Masterly use of dof. You''ve got a lovely feel in this shot. Shame about the burnt out highlights top-right. 9</td>', 'A beautiful composition. Masterly use of dof. You''ve got a lovely feel in this shot. Shame about the burnt out highlights top-right. 9', '2003-09-26 01:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(431164, 38476, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Not sure about your background though, or the leg poking out of the bottom of the frame. Other than that, this is a strong shot. 9</td>', 'Great shot! Not sure about your background though, or the leg poking out of the bottom of the frame. Other than that, this is a strong shot. 9', '2003-09-26 01:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(431167, 38935, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb picture. You''ve definitely got into the spirit of this challenge! This shot reflects the obsessive quality someone can have when they''re clock-watching. Perhaps like waiting for 5:00 for a 9-5 job, or the end of a lesson for a kid. And the slowing down that happens as you get more impatient, until it doesn''t move at all like viewing this picture. The green hue works nicely. However, I still feel it''s missing something I can''t quite put my finger on... maybe the use of another texture somewhere? 9</td>', 'Superb picture. You''ve definitely got into the spirit of this challenge! This shot reflects the obsessive quality someone can have when they''re clock-watching. Perhaps like waiting for 5:00 for a 9-5 job, or the end of a lesson for a kid. And the slowing down that happens as you get more impatient, until it doesn''t move at all like viewing this picture. The green hue works nicely. However, I still feel it''s missing something I can''t quite put my finger on... maybe the use of another texture somewhere? 9', '2003-09-26 01:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(431269, 38865, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great photo, most people seem to struggle with catching too much glare off these things (I haven''t had the opportunity to try!), and you''ve caught it perfectly.<br/>The lost feeling comes I think from the fact that you''re exploiting the top-right to bottom-left diagonal which goes against the diagonal people are most used to seeing in a composition. This works well for you here, although I think you might have come up with a better title! Some great colours and textures here, but it''s a shame his antennae is pointing out of the frame. 9</td>', 'Great photo, most people seem to struggle with catching too much glare off these things (I haven''t had the opportunity to try!), and you''ve caught it perfectly.The lost feeling comes I think from the fact that you''re exploiting the top-right to bottom-left diagonal which goes against the diagonal people are most used to seeing in a composition. This works well for you here, although I think you might have come up with a better title! Some great colours and textures here, but it''s a shame his antennae is pointing out of the frame. 9', '2003-09-26 03:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(431270, 38451, 8522, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the wasp in flight looking at the bottle top. Although I think this is a cleverly carried out shot, the colours and composition let this picture down for me. I wish the background was more effective, and the bottle wasn''t so centred. Shame about the glare on the bottle. 8</td>', 'Excellent capture of the wasp in flight looking at the bottle top. Although I think this is a cleverly carried out shot, the colours and composition let this picture down for me. I wish the background was more effective, and the bottle wasn''t so centred. Shame about the glare on the bottle. 8', '2003-09-26 03:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(431271, 38871, 8522, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, great use of light and shadow. The light around her eyes is particularly effective. However, this seems too much like a conventional portrait to be in a macro challenge. 8<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-29 04:07:43.</i></td>', 'Excellent shot, great use of light and shadow. The light around her eyes is particularly effective. However, this seems too much like a conventional portrait to be in a macro challenge. 8', '2003-09-26 03:39:42.000000', '2003-09-29 05:07:43.000000', 1),
(431272, 38134, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract, great combination of colours. The white in the foreground is very effective. 8</td>', 'Very nice abstract, great combination of colours. The white in the foreground is very effective. 8', '2003-09-26 04:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(431300, 38458, 10084, '<td valign="top">With a bit more sharpness or contrast you could really bring out the spider. The blurring of the background helps, but the spider needs more to really make it pop out of the pictue.</td>', 'With a bit more sharpness or contrast you could really bring out the spider. The blurring of the background helps, but the spider needs more to really make it pop out of the pictue.', '2003-09-26 04:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
