(431581, 38146, 10084, '<td valign="top">The bright blue sky really helps to frame the statue and make it stand out. Beautiful vivid shadows and bright reflections in the statue really help make it come alive. The angle that you made the shot gives it great interest and makes for a good composition.</td>', 'The bright blue sky really helps to frame the statue and make it stand out. Beautiful vivid shadows and bright reflections in the statue really help make it come alive. The angle that you made the shot gives it great interest and makes for a good composition.', '2003-09-26 13:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(431582, 38792, 2333, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple, well done. NIce smooth noise-free background. 640x480 doesn''t do this image justice at all, since the fibers are just barely a pixel wide after reduction, and so they seem to partly disappear at some points. Can''t help that though.</td>', 'Beautiful, simple, well done. NIce smooth noise-free background. 640x480 doesn''t do this image justice at all, since the fibers are just barely a pixel wide after reduction, and so they seem to partly disappear at some points. Can''t help that though.', '2003-09-26 13:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(431583, 38824, 4494, '<td valign="top">Well you did fit the challenge alright. :)   Close-ups like this are amazing, you must one awsome macro lens.  The pic could be a little bigger, but I''m thinking you probably had to crop this a little get this "close".</td>', 'Well you did fit the challenge alright. :)   Close-ups like this are amazing, you must one awsome macro lens.  The pic could be a little bigger, but I''m thinking you probably had to crop this a little get this "close".', '2003-09-26 13:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
