(431598, 38409, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s a tiny snake... good job photoing it with the apple because that gives you a sense of "up close" and "macro".  If you just took the snake itself, there would be no way to tell.  You could have gotten a little closer as well.   Turn off the camera''s auto-time stamp thing. :)<br/></td>', 'Wow that''s a tiny snake... good job photoing it with the apple because that gives you a sense of "up close" and "macro".  If you just took the snake itself, there would be no way to tell.  You could have gotten a little closer as well.   Turn off the camera''s auto-time stamp thing. :)', '2003-09-26 13:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
