(431639, 38721, 3447, '<td valign="top">Stunning detail and color.   This is the Blue Ribbon photograph.</td>', 'Stunning detail and color.   This is the Blue Ribbon photograph.', '2003-09-26 14:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(431640, 38477, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks a little out of focus.  It may be because your lens was to perfectly perpendicular to the penny, which is indicated by the "ovalness" of the penny.</td>', 'Looks a little out of focus.  It may be because your lens was to perfectly perpendicular to the penny, which is indicated by the "ovalness" of the penny.', '2003-09-26 14:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(431641, 38052, 3447, '<td valign="top">Nice landing spot for this ugly bugger.  Fly detail seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice landing spot for this ugly bugger.  Fly detail seems a bit soft.', '2003-09-26 14:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(431642, 38678, 4494, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark shadows moving into the bright whites of the flower.</td>', 'I really like the dark shadows moving into the bright whites of the flower.', '2003-09-26 14:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(431644, 38606, 3447, '<td valign="top">Good sharp detail.   Not sure about the composition/crop.</td>', 'Good sharp detail.   Not sure about the composition/crop.', '2003-09-26 14:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(431645, 38982, 4494, '<td valign="top">Haaahahahahaaa, that''s great!!   :D :D  Shot is very well done also.  This one will do well because it''s funny AND very well done.</td>', 'Haaahahahahaaa, that''s great!!   :D :D  Shot is very well done also.  This one will do well because it''s funny AND very well done.', '2003-09-26 14:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(431647, 38955, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;W, it shows off the gray spectrum well.</td>', 'Nice use of B&W, it shows off the gray spectrum well.', '2003-09-26 14:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(431648, 38109, 4494, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what this is.  A mouse trap???</td>', 'Can''t tell what this is.  A mouse trap???', '2003-09-26 14:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(431669, 38874, 7778, '<td valign="top">Delicious, classic!<br/> <br/>The natural colours and tones (ah, what lighting!) are captured impeccably. The arrangement is both simple and strong. The perspective is appropiately conservative and straightforward, encouranging an almost tactile exploration of the image. Due to subtle lighting, the crispness of the shallow dof may be missed by the hurried viewer.<br/> <br/>There is no other entry that captivated me more than this one! Thank you.<br/> <br/>[A minute note: the background texture (table surface?), although a gorgeous olive/umber, appears as if stained by brush, at one time, perhaps to achieve an antique look. It is the only remotely questionable ingredient in this otherwise so convincingly authentic capture.]   <br/> <br/></td>', 'Delicious, classic! The natural colours and tones (ah, what lighting!) are captured impeccably. The arrangement is both simple and strong. The perspective is appropiately conservative and straightforward, encouranging an almost tactile exploration of the image. Due to subtle lighting, the crispness of the shallow dof may be missed by the hurried viewer. There is no other entry that captivated me more than this one! Thank you. [A minute note: the background texture (table surface?), although a gorgeous olive/umber, appears as if stained by brush, at one time, perhaps to achieve an antique look. It is the only remotely questionable ingredient in this otherwise so convincingly authentic capture.]    ', '2003-09-26 15:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(431725, 38739, 11457, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The shallow DoF pulls my eyes yo the bottom-right. I would be curious to see it with the whole clock surface in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice composition. The shallow DoF pulls my eyes yo the bottom-right. I would be curious to see it with the whole clock surface in sharp focus.', '2003-09-26 16:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(431727, 38814, 11457, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The desaturation left back some artifacts where the syringe is joined with the needle.</td>', 'Nice idea. The desaturation left back some artifacts where the syringe is joined with the needle.', '2003-09-26 16:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(431729, 38813, 11457, '<td valign="top">Impressive shot! Nice composition too. The (slightly overexposed) glare on the wings is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Impressive shot! Nice composition too. The (slightly overexposed) glare on the wings is a bit distracting though.', '2003-09-26 16:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(431733, 38537, 11457, '<td valign="top">Nice composition! Is the bottom-right part metallic, or just slightly over-sharpened?</td>', 'Nice composition! Is the bottom-right part metallic, or just slightly over-sharpened?', '2003-09-26 16:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(431737, 38518, 11457, '<td valign="top">Great subject. I wish it was less noisy.</td>', 'Great subject. I wish it was less noisy.', '2003-09-26 16:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(431738, 38976, 11457, '<td valign="top">Intriguing. I wonder how it would have looked with the subject off-center and the rod in a vertical position.</td>', 'Intriguing. I wonder how it would have looked with the subject off-center and the rod in a vertical position.', '2003-09-26 16:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(431741, 38046, 11457, '<td valign="top">lol! I wish the name of the Enterprise was in sharp focus. Good composition too.</td>', 'lol! I wish the name of the Enterprise was in sharp focus. Good composition too.', '2003-09-26 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(431743, 38971, 11457, '<td valign="top">Love it. :)</td>', 'Love it. :)', '2003-09-26 16:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(431746, 38366, 11457, '<td valign="top">Good shot, maybe slightly on the dark side. Off-centering the yellow flower would have made the image more powerful, maybe.</td>', 'Good shot, maybe slightly on the dark side. Off-centering the yellow flower would have made the image more powerful, maybe.', '2003-09-26 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(431750, 38959, 11457, '<td valign="top">She''s not asleep, she''s smiling. :) Beautiful light and composition.</td>', 'She''s not asleep, she''s smiling. :) Beautiful light and composition.', '2003-09-26 16:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(431756, 38476, 3447, '<td valign="top">Very good macro !      Terrific detail in nose and eyes.   Antennae remind me of the horns on a mean bull we had on the ranch.</td>', 'Very good macro !      Terrific detail in nose and eyes.   Antennae remind me of the horns on a mean bull we had on the ranch.', '2003-09-26 16:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(431758, 38667, 11457, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  I would have enjoyed it more had the focused area been closer to the observer.</td>', 'Cool idea.  I would have enjoyed it more had the focused area been closer to the observer.', '2003-09-26 16:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(431762, 38909, 10825, '<td valign="top">very cool photo, neat effect! good job!</td>', 'very cool photo, neat effect! good job!', '2003-09-26 17:02:22.000000', NULL, 1);
