(431901, 38686, 6504, '<td valign="top">The colors are good, and the peach is appealing.   What is lacking I think is more light on the peach to highlighti it.</td>', 'The colors are good, and the peach is appealing.   What is lacking I think is more light on the peach to highlighti it.', '2003-09-26 20:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(431903, 38620, 11283, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo...a bit fuzzy though</td>', 'Really nice photo...a bit fuzzy though', '2003-09-26 20:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(431906, 38856, 11283, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple shot. Looks like a calendar photo(compliment).</td>', 'Nice and simple shot. Looks like a calendar photo(compliment).', '2003-09-26 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(431910, 38865, 11283, '<td valign="top">Another good name for this would be "Belly up to the bug bar!" Nice photo.</td>', 'Another good name for this would be "Belly up to the bug bar!" Nice photo.', '2003-09-26 20:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(431914, 38620, 9441, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the droplets...looks nice...</td>', 'I like the color and the droplets...looks nice...', '2003-09-26 20:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(431915, 38228, 11283, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. The blob at the bottom is magnificent. I think this would be better if the skin were cropped out IMHO.</td>', 'Very cool image. The blob at the bottom is magnificent. I think this would be better if the skin were cropped out IMHO.', '2003-09-26 20:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(431918, 38990, 11283, '<td valign="top">Very simple image but the execution is excellent. This should be on the wall at a winery except for the thermos on the cork. Hehe. Or is thermos a fancy wine? I''m a beer drinker.</td>', 'Very simple image but the execution is excellent. This should be on the wall at a winery except for the thermos on the cork. Hehe. Or is thermos a fancy wine? I''m a beer drinker.', '2003-09-26 20:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(431924, 38914, 6504, '<td valign="top">I think this is excellent!! The red color of the thread woven around artistically, and the needle highlighted.   Very good The most creative of all the submissions in my opinion.  9</td>', 'I think this is excellent!! The red color of the thread woven around artistically, and the needle highlighted.   Very good The most creative of all the submissions in my opinion.  9', '2003-09-26 20:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(431925, 38733, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice under view of the leaves and flower...good closeup, nice lighting and color</td>', 'nice under view of the leaves and flower...good closeup, nice lighting and color', '2003-09-26 20:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(431929, 38722, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice, soft and pretty macro...</td>', 'nice, soft and pretty macro...', '2003-09-26 20:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(431931, 38721, 9441, '<td valign="top">very nice closeup, just a slight bit blurry at the bottom, but still a great photo</td>', 'very nice closeup, just a slight bit blurry at the bottom, but still a great photo', '2003-09-26 20:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(431932, 38537, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s a close view of this archway, but technically, it''s not  macro (IMHO).  The angle is a bit odd, but that might be working for you in interest.  I really like the bird nests in the upper right corner.  Good detail, nice textures, clear shot!  5 for such a good picture, 1 for the challenge.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'It''s a close view of this archway, but technically, it''s not  macro (IMHO).  The angle is a bit odd, but that might be working for you in interest.  I really like the bird nests in the upper right corner.  Good detail, nice textures, clear shot!  5 for such a good picture, 1 for the challenge.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-26 20:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(431934, 38449, 12076, '<td valign="top">Finally, a good cat photo!  Nice...</td>', 'Finally, a good cat photo!  Nice...', '2003-09-26 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(431936, 39002, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo for everything, but the slug''s body (very over-exposed).  You might want to try different white balance or different (wider) spot metering.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Good photo for everything, but the slug''s body (very over-exposed).  You might want to try different white balance or different (wider) spot metering.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-26 20:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(431937, 38792, 9441, '<td valign="top">shows good detail...background chosen was good selection....</td>', 'shows good detail...background chosen was good selection....', '2003-09-26 20:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(431939, 38813, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp!  You might want to try a different white balance or darken the right wings a bit more (and not crop it, too, oh and then there''s the glare).   7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very sharp!  You might want to try a different white balance or darken the right wings a bit more (and not crop it, too, oh and then there''s the glare).   7 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-26 20:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(431940, 39001, 1005, '<td valign="top">OMG, I really enjoyed this photo!  Excellent clarity (love the hair do coming off the back of it''s head).  Great color and exposure (zero glare!!).  Good thing it didn''t decide to strike your lens!  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'OMG, I really enjoyed this photo!  Excellent clarity (love the hair do coming off the back of it''s head).  Great color and exposure (zero glare!!).  Good thing it didn''t decide to strike your lens!  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-26 20:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(431944, 38438, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really enjoyed the action of this photo.  Wonderful view.  (the glass is overly cloudy at my local zoo, lucky you!)  Loved everything about this shot!  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Really enjoyed the action of this photo.  Wonderful view.  (the glass is overly cloudy at my local zoo, lucky you!)  Loved everything about this shot!  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-26 20:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(431945, 38088, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lovely set up.  Extremely well taken shot.  Nicely exposed.  The trailing off seed is a great touch (it must have taken forever to set up!)  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Lovely set up.  Extremely well taken shot.  Nicely exposed.  The trailing off seed is a great touch (it must have taken forever to set up!)  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-26 20:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(431996, 38351, 10402, '<td valign="top">Unique perspective of the pencil. I wish it was better focused.</td>', 'Unique perspective of the pencil. I wish it was better focused.', '2003-09-26 21:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(431997, 38967, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very creative and appealing.  I wonder how it would look with the shadows in the opposite direction separating the white balls from the white background.<br/>Excellent as it is though.</td>', 'Very creative and appealing.  I wonder how it would look with the shadows in the opposite direction separating the white balls from the white background.Excellent as it is though.', '2003-09-26 21:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(432008, 38476, 9904, '<td valign="top">Scarry Creacher</td>', 'Scarry Creacher', '2003-09-26 21:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(432023, 38438, 7969, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wonderful shot, I really love it, the  bubbles are fabulous, his expression and composition are good too.   What I really want to know though, is... did you bring windex and cleaning supplies to the zoo?? The glass at our zoo/aquarium is always fingerprinted ect... how did you get it so clear still???  good work</td>', 'I think this is a wonderful shot, I really love it, the  bubbles are fabulous, his expression and composition are good too.   What I really want to know though, is... did you bring windex and cleaning supplies to the zoo?? The glass at our zoo/aquarium is always fingerprinted ect... how did you get it so clear still???  good work', '2003-09-26 21:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(432065, 38914, 10978, '<td valign="top">WOW!!! I love it 10 and no doubt a winner ...WOW</td>', 'WOW!!! I love it 10 and no doubt a winner ...WOW', '2003-09-26 23:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(432086, 37996, 10799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-09-27 00:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(432092, 38754, 10084, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast to help bring the subject out of the picture. The framing helps to give a sense of depth. Nice reflections.</td>', 'Needs more contrast to help bring the subject out of the picture. The framing helps to give a sense of depth. Nice reflections.', '2003-09-27 00:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(432093, 38900, 10084, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors in the eyes. A little more contrast would help the fur frame the eye better. You have some decent shadows in the fur but not enough to give it a wow. What happen to the frame?</td>', 'Really nice colors in the eyes. A little more contrast would help the fur frame the eye better. You have some decent shadows in the fur but not enough to give it a wow. What happen to the frame?', '2003-09-27 00:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(432095, 38352, 10084, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is decent. The leaf as a lot of details. The ligthing is helping you get some vivid shadows.Need a more interesting subject. Everything you see are leaves. Maybe if there was a flower in the shot or different colored leaves.</td>', 'Depth of field is decent. The leaf as a lot of details. The ligthing is helping you get some vivid shadows.Need a more interesting subject. Everything you see are leaves. Maybe if there was a flower in the shot or different colored leaves.', '2003-09-27 00:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(432099, 38996, 10084, '<td valign="top">The dark background and the framing really help to make the shell pop out of the picture. Love the great ripples in the shell. Playing with the lighting you would get some really vivid dark patterns and make the picture a lot more interesting.</td>', 'The dark background and the framing really help to make the shell pop out of the picture. Love the great ripples in the shell. Playing with the lighting you would get some really vivid dark patterns and make the picture a lot more interesting.', '2003-09-27 00:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(432102, 38038, 10084, '<td valign="top">Need more contrast to really make the subjects pop out of the picture. Playing with levels to darken the darks would really enhance this picture. A little sharpness would help also. Otherwise a fairly good composition.</td>', 'Need more contrast to really make the subjects pop out of the picture. Playing with levels to darken the darks would really enhance this picture. A little sharpness would help also. Otherwise a fairly good composition.', '2003-09-27 00:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(432104, 38812, 10084, '<td valign="top">Fairly interesting shot of the ants hard at work inside a plant. Beautiful colors in the flower itself. I can''t help but want more focus in on the ants themselves.</td>', 'Fairly interesting shot of the ants hard at work inside a plant. Beautiful colors in the flower itself. I can''t help but want more focus in on the ants themselves.', '2003-09-27 00:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(432107, 38518, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  A bit of noise . Lessen the ISO should help a bit. It would give the colors more vibrant colors.Darken the black in levels would make the subjects stand out more. I like the prickly needle coming from the plant.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  A bit of noise . Lessen the ISO should help a bit. It would give the colors more vibrant colors.Darken the black in levels would make the subjects stand out more. I like the prickly needle coming from the plant.', '2003-09-27 00:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(432109, 38181, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great closeup. Really shows the grit and grime of the gears. I like the hue that you were able to capture helps to show oldness. Great reflections and shadows help bring out the details.</td>', 'Great closeup. Really shows the grit and grime of the gears. I like the hue that you were able to capture helps to show oldness. Great reflections and shadows help bring out the details.', '2003-09-27 00:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(432111, 38667, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great job with the depth of field. Love the colors separating the different types of beans. The beautiful shadows and the reflections help to bring out the subjects in the picture.</td>', 'Great job with the depth of field. Love the colors separating the different types of beans. The beautiful shadows and the reflections help to bring out the subjects in the picture.', '2003-09-27 00:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(432114, 38904, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections and shadows in the reflector. Great patterns in the bulb also. Very nice colors help to give interest to the composition.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections and shadows in the reflector. Great patterns in the bulb also. Very nice colors help to give interest to the composition.', '2003-09-27 00:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(432115, 37984, 9441, '<td valign="top">cool photo...interesting concept...</td>', 'cool photo...interesting concept...', '2003-09-27 01:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(432116, 38568, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice closeup...one of the better ones I''ve seen yet of a ring, I like the way you angled the ring, it doesn''t overpower the photo, yet still looks interesting and clear.....good job.</td>', 'nice closeup...one of the better ones I''ve seen yet of a ring, I like the way you angled the ring, it doesn''t overpower the photo, yet still looks interesting and clear.....good job.', '2003-09-27 01:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
