(432758, 38734, 12311, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the green background.  I''d suggest that removal of the leaves in the lower right would be a big improvement.  They''re a bit distracting.  Excellent effort, though.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the green background.  I''d suggest that removal of the leaves in the lower right would be a big improvement.  They''re a bit distracting.  Excellent effort, though.', '2003-09-27 22:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(432759, 39007, 6202, '<td valign="top">Fantastic details.  Made me actually stop and look at it.  Very nice and orginal take on this challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'Fantastic details.  Made me actually stop and look at it.  Very nice and orginal take on this challenge.  Well done.', '2003-09-27 22:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(432760, 38800, 12311, '<td valign="top">Damn those trolls, but I hate to say it... It wasn''t just the trolls that ruined it.  Just too much clutter for my taste.  ...And is that a camera lens in the forground?</td>', 'Damn those trolls, but I hate to say it... It wasn''t just the trolls that ruined it.  Just too much clutter for my taste.  ...And is that a camera lens in the forground?', '2003-09-27 22:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(432775, 38878, 8860, '<td valign="top">Odd title but a very nice shot. Good DOF and excellent subject.</td>', 'Odd title but a very nice shot. Good DOF and excellent subject.', '2003-09-27 22:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(432838, 38406, 5873, '<td valign="top">Call me dense, but I don''t understand the title. Also, I would have personally gone without the border. To each his own though ;-) Good job.</td>', 'Call me dense, but I don''t understand the title. Also, I would have personally gone without the border. To each his own though ;-) Good job.', '2003-09-28 00:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(432839, 38060, 5873, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. The bright white at the left is a little distracting. Great job.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. The bright white at the left is a little distracting. Great job.', '2003-09-28 00:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(432840, 38971, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting shows the internal texture of both fruits clearly, and both would be interesting by themselves. Putting them together to compare their similarities and differences makes a great photo.</td>', 'The lighting shows the internal texture of both fruits clearly, and both would be interesting by themselves. Putting them together to compare their similarities and differences makes a great photo.', '2003-09-28 00:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(432841, 38192, 5873, '<td valign="top">This is one of the very few photos I''ve seen where a border actually compliments the image. Well done. :-)</td>', 'This is one of the very few photos I''ve seen where a border actually compliments the image. Well done. :-)', '2003-09-28 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(432842, 38951, 10402, '<td valign="top">Colorful and interesting design. Good lighting.</td>', 'Colorful and interesting design. Good lighting.', '2003-09-28 00:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(432844, 38300, 5873, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the white border, but other than that a very nice photo. Good job</td>', 'I don''t really care for the white border, but other than that a very nice photo. Good job', '2003-09-28 00:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(432847, 38881, 5873, '<td valign="top">For some reason I think I would''ve liked the picture better without the second in the background. Maybe a bit distracting? Otherwise very well done</td>', 'For some reason I think I would''ve liked the picture better without the second in the background. Maybe a bit distracting? Otherwise very well done', '2003-09-28 00:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(432848, 38146, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good lighting; it shows off the sculpted contours very well.</td>', 'Good lighting; it shows off the sculpted contours very well.', '2003-09-28 00:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(432849, 38939, 10402, '<td valign="top">The small shells provide an effective background texture. The large shell is the obvious center of interest in this image; it should be in focus.</td>', 'The small shells provide an effective background texture. The large shell is the obvious center of interest in this image; it should be in focus.', '2003-09-28 00:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(432850, 38757, 10402, '<td valign="top">The shadows are as interesting as the pods themselves; excellent lighting.</td>', 'The shadows are as interesting as the pods themselves; excellent lighting.', '2003-09-28 00:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(432852, 39006, 10402, '<td valign="top">The broach itself is nice, but I really like the way you have a circle of lights that mirrors the components of the broach.</td>', 'The broach itself is nice, but I really like the way you have a circle of lights that mirrors the components of the broach.', '2003-09-28 01:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(432855, 38660, 10402, '<td valign="top">An ugly thing, but it make an interesting photo. You''ve captured the texture and workmanship of this sculpture very well.</td>', 'An ugly thing, but it make an interesting photo. You''ve captured the texture and workmanship of this sculpture very well.', '2003-09-28 01:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(432857, 38763, 10402, '<td valign="top">The background is nice, but the ring itself is a bit blurry and many of the details are burned out.</td>', 'The background is nice, but the ring itself is a bit blurry and many of the details are burned out.', '2003-09-28 01:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(432858, 38129, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good focus and "fill the frame" composition.</td>', 'Good focus and "fill the frame" composition.', '2003-09-28 01:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(432861, 38934, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lighting. It would be more dynamic if there was some motion blur with the yo-yo spinning. It''s a little boring just sitting there.</td>', 'I like the composition and lighting. It would be more dynamic if there was some motion blur with the yo-yo spinning. It''s a little boring just sitting there.', '2003-09-28 01:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(432863, 38296, 10402, '<td valign="top">Focusing just on the small circles with the larger patterns blurred but discernable makes this an interesting abstract image.</td>', 'Focusing just on the small circles with the larger patterns blurred but discernable makes this an interesting abstract image.', '2003-09-28 01:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(432866, 38856, 10402, '<td valign="top">Youve captured the contrasting textures of leaf and water very well. That would make an interesting image itself, but the brilliant color of the leaf adds that extra impact to make this a great photo.</td>', 'Youve captured the contrasting textures of leaf and water very well. That would make an interesting image itself, but the brilliant color of the leaf adds that extra impact to make this a great photo.', '2003-09-28 01:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(432868, 38406, 10402, '<td valign="top">A humorous way to add a bit of interest to an otherwise boring subject.</td>', 'A humorous way to add a bit of interest to an otherwise boring subject.', '2003-09-28 01:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(432874, 38338, 6325, '<td valign="top">The lower 2/3 is nice. The view of the nostril distracts in the upper 1/3 and pulls down the overall quality.</td>', 'The lower 2/3 is nice. The view of the nostril distracts in the upper 1/3 and pulls down the overall quality.', '2003-09-28 01:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(432877, 38409, 10402, '<td valign="top">I''d always pictured the Genesis serpent to be a bit bigger. This image has a lesson for those that believe in Genesis: small temptations are as bad as big ones.<br/> <br/>But on to the photo: I really like the way the snake is posed, the inclusion of part of the snake in the shadow, and the conrasts in color and texture between the snake and apple. Well focused and good composition. Some sharpening would help bring out the textures.</td>', 'I''d always pictured the Genesis serpent to be a bit bigger. This image has a lesson for those that believe in Genesis: small temptations are as bad as big ones. But on to the photo: I really like the way the snake is posed, the inclusion of part of the snake in the shadow, and the conrasts in color and texture between the snake and apple. Well focused and good composition. Some sharpening would help bring out the textures.', '2003-09-28 01:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(432878, 38969, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of color. Some sharpening would bring out the details in the wings.</td>', 'Good composition and use of color. Some sharpening would bring out the details in the wings.', '2003-09-28 02:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(432888, 38677, 1686, '<td valign="top">Truely evil looking. The BW  enhances the effect.</td>', 'Truely evil looking. The BW  enhances the effect.', '2003-09-28 02:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(432890, 38982, 4767, '<td valign="top">And I thought MY toothpaste tasted bad...  NICE shot!</td>', 'And I thought MY toothpaste tasted bad...  NICE shot!', '2003-09-28 02:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(432891, 38856, 1686, '<td valign="top">I especially like the effect that the motion of the water gives</td>', 'I especially like the effect that the motion of the water gives', '2003-09-28 02:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(432892, 38733, 4767, '<td valign="top">interesting composition!</td>', 'interesting composition!', '2003-09-28 02:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
