(432934, 38227, 1863, '<td valign="top">The light seems a bit harsh in this picture.. perhaps cover the light source with a piece of white paper to dim it a bit, which may be helpful. Good use of colour.</td>', 'The light seems a bit harsh in this picture.. perhaps cover the light source with a piece of white paper to dim it a bit, which may be helpful. Good use of colour.', '2003-09-28 08:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(432935, 38474, 1863, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how much you .. intended this, but it reminds me a LOT of uhm.. women''s genitals, and I think that''s GREAT! Lovely innuendo. Very interesting that it should look that way.. I''ll never be able to look at another apple in quite the same way. Thank you for that :) Very enjoyable macro.</td>', 'I don''t know how much you .. intended this, but it reminds me a LOT of uhm.. women''s genitals, and I think that''s GREAT! Lovely innuendo. Very interesting that it should look that way.. I''ll never be able to look at another apple in quite the same way. Thank you for that :) Very enjoyable macro.', '2003-09-28 09:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(432940, 37882, 1863, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very interesting plant.. I also think it would have been better without the glare of the lights on the right hand side.. I don''t like your border very much. it''s intrusive, and just doesn''t fit the shades of the plant.. other than that, wow. cool shot!</td>', 'I think this is a very interesting plant.. I also think it would have been better without the glare of the lights on the right hand side.. I don''t like your border very much. it''s intrusive, and just doesn''t fit the shades of the plant.. other than that, wow. cool shot!', '2003-09-28 09:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(432942, 38914, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I love the flow of the lines in the frame.  Red thread was a good idea too.  Nice work, and well taken 9</td>', 'Great idea.  I love the flow of the lines in the frame.  Red thread was a good idea too.  Nice work, and well taken 9', '2003-09-28 09:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(432944, 38660, 3540, '<td valign="top">Eddie! Eddie! Eddie! Eddie!  I went to go see Maiden 8-6-03.   They were very good too.  And you''re right, it''s better than any flower macro I''ve seen in this challenge (so far) 7</td>', 'Eddie! Eddie! Eddie! Eddie!  I went to go see Maiden 8-6-03.   They were very good too.  And you''re right, it''s better than any flower macro I''ve seen in this challenge (so far) 7', '2003-09-28 09:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(432945, 38999, 3540, '<td valign="top">Just take him out of the freezer?  He has condensation on him.  His leg is a bit oddly bent too.  Maybe you didn''t but I have a funny feeling he''s in grasshopper heaven right now.</td>', 'Just take him out of the freezer?  He has condensation on him.  His leg is a bit oddly bent too.  Maybe you didn''t but I have a funny feeling he''s in grasshopper heaven right now.', '2003-09-28 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(432947, 38832, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think without the color, this picture has lost some of the warmth it would''ve had in color.  It just seems a little cold.</td>', 'I think without the color, this picture has lost some of the warmth it would''ve had in color.  It just seems a little cold.', '2003-09-28 10:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(432948, 38038, 3540, '<td valign="top">Really grainy photo.  I''m curious to see what camera was used to take this photo.  I also am wondering what the ISO is.</td>', 'Really grainy photo.  I''m curious to see what camera was used to take this photo.  I also am wondering what the ISO is.', '2003-09-28 10:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(432949, 38001, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good texture shot.  The little spots of green make this photo a little warmer and a little more alive, but I am curious to know what this shot looks like greyscale.  I''ve seen a similar shot in black and white and it made for a very interesting texture shot as well.  This is pretty good though.</td>', 'Good texture shot.  The little spots of green make this photo a little warmer and a little more alive, but I am curious to know what this shot looks like greyscale.  I''ve seen a similar shot in black and white and it made for a very interesting texture shot as well.  This is pretty good though.', '2003-09-28 10:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(432950, 38939, 3540, '<td valign="top">Socialistic interpretation of our neighbo(u)rs to the North?  Interesting photo, and one that looks like it took a few minutes to set up.  Well taken.</td>', 'Socialistic interpretation of our neighbo(u)rs to the North?  Interesting photo, and one that looks like it took a few minutes to set up.  Well taken.', '2003-09-28 10:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
