(433041, 38892, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Lighting is slightly harsh in the vertical facets of the nest, but definition and compsotion are good. I like it.</td>', 'Nice. Lighting is slightly harsh in the vertical facets of the nest, but definition and compsotion are good. I like it.', '2003-09-28 16:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
