(433055, 38872, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice, but a little blurry. Faster shutter speed needed, I think. It''s a shame, because I''ve tried to take a similar shot on many occasions and it''s not easy. You''ve caught the bee in the frame well, but it''s just not sharp enough. Sorry.</td>', 'Nice, but a little blurry. Faster shutter speed needed, I think. It''s a shame, because I''ve tried to take a similar shot on many occasions and it''s not easy. You''ve caught the bee in the frame well, but it''s just not sharp enough. Sorry.', '2003-09-28 17:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(433058, 38967, 11570, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm!!!!  Abstract art well composed/exposed though the mints do look a bit OOF.</td>', 'Hmmmm!!!!  Abstract art well composed/exposed though the mints do look a bit OOF.', '2003-09-28 17:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
