(433270, 38642, 10084, '<td valign="top">More contrast or levels tweaking should bring out the shadow and reflections. This would help the egg pop out of the picture even more then it is already. It would probably make the cotton balls even more fluffy.</td>', 'More contrast or levels tweaking should bring out the shadow and reflections. This would help the egg pop out of the picture even more then it is already. It would probably make the cotton balls even more fluffy.', '2003-09-28 21:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(433272, 38972, 4871, '<td valign="top">A very nicely balanced submission. Great detail and I love the matching background! Well done :)</td>', 'A very nicely balanced submission. Great detail and I love the matching background! Well done :)', '2003-09-28 21:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(433274, 38881, 4871, '<td valign="top">Your composition has a little too much contrast. If this is something that has been done in photoshop (which I am guessing due to the graininess) I think that you cheated yourself of otherwise a great picture. Also I think a little less DOF would have been better, although that is personal opinion.</td>', 'Your composition has a little too much contrast. If this is something that has been done in photoshop (which I am guessing due to the graininess) I think that you cheated yourself of otherwise a great picture. Also I think a little less DOF would have been better, although that is personal opinion.', '2003-09-28 21:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(433275, 37996, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy moody picture. Beautiful flower picture. Would work great as a wedding card, invite, or thank you card. Great depth of field helps to really bring out the single flower. Can''t wait to hear how you did this shot.</td>', 'Nice dreamy moody picture. Beautiful flower picture. Would work great as a wedding card, invite, or thank you card. Great depth of field helps to really bring out the single flower. Can''t wait to hear how you did this shot.', '2003-09-28 21:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(433277, 38300, 4871, '<td valign="top">They don''t make them like they used to!... which is probalby a good thing! Great idea and great shot. Thought the whites were a bit blown out and I don''t think it would have hurt to see more of the lens, but rates well in my books :)</td>', 'They don''t make them like they used to!... which is probalby a good thing! Great idea and great shot. Thought the whites were a bit blown out and I don''t think it would have hurt to see more of the lens, but rates well in my books :)', '2003-09-28 21:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(433278, 38965, 4871, '<td valign="top">Flashes are not best used in macros. Natural lighting will achieve a much more balanced result. A bit soft too.</td>', 'Flashes are not best used in macros. Natural lighting will achieve a much more balanced result. A bit soft too.', '2003-09-28 21:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(433279, 38966, 4871, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. How did you get the soft look? Love the falloff into black on the right. Great shot!</td>', 'Very nicely composed. How did you get the soft look? Love the falloff into black on the right. Great shot!', '2003-09-28 21:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(433283, 38670, 4871, '<td valign="top">Wow! A great submission! Perfectly balanced in my opinion and just a great looking shot. Pity about the graininess.</td>', 'Wow! A great submission! Perfectly balanced in my opinion and just a great looking shot. Pity about the graininess.', '2003-09-28 21:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(433285, 38955, 4871, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Framing is perfect and I love the detail in the wood before it falls off into the DOF. Amazing how powerful B&amp;W can be!</td>', 'Very nice! Framing is perfect and I love the detail in the wood before it falls off into the DOF. Amazing how powerful B&W can be!', '2003-09-28 21:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
