(433338, 38011, 10084, '<td valign="top">Gread closeup of a padlock. The engraved lettering really pops out of the shot. The vivid shadows and reflections really help to bring out the " Yale" lettering. The rest of the lock almost looks like a neat abstract painting especially the top right corner and the lower right corner. Pretty cool effect. Framing seem to lighten the inside.</td>', 'Gread closeup of a padlock. The engraved lettering really pops out of the shot. The vivid shadows and reflections really help to bring out the " Yale" lettering. The rest of the lock almost looks like a neat abstract painting especially the top right corner and the lower right corner. Pretty cool effect. Framing seem to lighten the inside.', '2003-09-28 22:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(433339, 38754, 6771, '<td valign="top">Like the low key.  could use a bit more contrast and more focus, to bring out the rest of the image.  I can tell the focus is on the smooth, but I would like all of it with more detail.</td>', 'Like the low key.  could use a bit more contrast and more focus, to bring out the rest of the image.  I can tell the focus is on the smooth, but I would like all of it with more detail.', '2003-09-28 22:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
