(433341, 38278, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great lighting in the shot. You were able to capture some really good shadows casted onto the egg. The reflections and the shadows on the wisk are absolutely beautiful, very vivid. Would make for a great post card or greeting card with a cooking theme.</td>', 'Great lighting in the shot. You were able to capture some really good shadows casted onto the egg. The reflections and the shadows on the wisk are absolutely beautiful, very vivid. Would make for a great post card or greeting card with a cooking theme.', '2003-09-28 22:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(433342, 38409, 6771, '<td valign="top">great idea and background, but it is a bit too bright all around.  deeper tones and touch darker would bring the snake out more and look a lot richer in color.  little soft focus on the snake where it should be sharper</td>', 'great idea and background, but it is a bit too bright all around.  deeper tones and touch darker would bring the snake out more and look a lot richer in color.  little soft focus on the snake where it should be sharper', '2003-09-28 22:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(433354, 38643, 5351, '<td valign="top">Really like the composition and colors of this - however I would experiment with lighting - my eye is drawn more th the top and bottom of the glass than what I want to look at - which is the marbles.  Very good DOF:)</td>', 'Really like the composition and colors of this - however I would experiment with lighting - my eye is drawn more th the top and bottom of the glass than what I want to look at - which is the marbles.  Very good DOF:)', '2003-09-28 22:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
