(433386, 38179, 10084, '<td valign="top">A bit or sharpen and contrast would help you make the subjects pop out of the shot. Currently the subject looks flat. Playing with the lighting would also help. Trying to make more vivid shadows and reflections on the metal would make the textures in it feel real.</td>', 'A bit or sharpen and contrast would help you make the subjects pop out of the shot. Currently the subject looks flat. Playing with the lighting would also help. Trying to make more vivid shadows and reflections on the metal would make the textures in it feel real.', '2003-09-28 23:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
