(433390, 38722, 10084, '<td valign="top">I would like this photo even more if you were to tone the lighting down more. Usually roses look very good when you are able to see the vivid shadows in the petals. It helps to make the rose more 3D and seems more realistic. <br/>The way you have the lighting it almost gives a dreamy mood to the subject. If this is your idea is perfect.</td>', 'I would like this photo even more if you were to tone the lighting down more. Usually roses look very good when you are able to see the vivid shadows in the petals. It helps to make the rose more 3D and seems more realistic. The way you have the lighting it almost gives a dreamy mood to the subject. If this is your idea is perfect.', '2003-09-28 23:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(433392, 38341, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good closeup of the seeds. The shadows and reflections really gives you a sense of the texture of the seed. The depth of field and the overblown background helps to push the foreground seed out of the picture.</td>', 'Good closeup of the seeds. The shadows and reflections really gives you a sense of the texture of the seed. The depth of field and the overblown background helps to push the foreground seed out of the picture.', '2003-09-28 23:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
