(433395, 38626, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful patterns of light coming from the reflections of the metallic balls. The cool blue background really helps to add interest to the shot. Very vivid shadows casted off the balls. Good composition.</td>', 'Beautiful patterns of light coming from the reflections of the metallic balls. The cool blue background really helps to add interest to the shot. Very vivid shadows casted off the balls. Good composition.', '2003-09-28 23:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(433398, 38449, 10084, '<td valign="top">What a ferocious looking cat. Love the great composition you were able to capture.  The shadows and reflections of the fur really helps make this image pop out of the shot. The reflections and details in the eyes really give you a sense of ferociousness.</td>', 'What a ferocious looking cat. Love the great composition you were able to capture.  The shadows and reflections of the fur really helps make this image pop out of the shot. The reflections and details in the eyes really give you a sense of ferociousness.', '2003-09-28 23:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(433400, 37864, 10084, '<td valign="top">The way that this was shot makes it seem almost like a color pencil drawing. The reflections really help highlight the frog. Lighting under the chin and on the face make for a very dramatic picture. The depth of field is good and the frog is push forward from the background.</td>', 'The way that this was shot makes it seem almost like a color pencil drawing. The reflections really help highlight the frog. Lighting under the chin and on the face make for a very dramatic picture. The depth of field is good and the frog is push forward from the background.', '2003-09-28 23:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(433401, 38853, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great closeup. The beautiful touch of red/orange/yellow in the center subject is really popping out of the image. The pink is really helping to bring out the colors of the center. Great gradutation of colors in there. You can almost feel the texture there also.</td>', 'Great closeup. The beautiful touch of red/orange/yellow in the center subject is really popping out of the image. The pink is really helping to bring out the colors of the center. Great gradutation of colors in there. You can almost feel the texture there also.', '2003-09-28 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
