(433428, 38931, 5351, '<td valign="top">Definately meets challenge.  I like the focus on the primary subject - and the colors are really good.  Although I normally like things to be left as they are naturally, I think in this case I would clean off the shell,  Also, I would try this without the second shell in the top right - I would rather focus on the one shell that is in such good focus!</td>', 'Definately meets challenge.  I like the focus on the primary subject - and the colors are really good.  Although I normally like things to be left as they are naturally, I think in this case I would clean off the shell,  Also, I would try this without the second shell in the top right - I would rather focus on the one shell that is in such good focus!', '2003-09-28 23:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
