(433455, 39002, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat subject, but I think the lighting betrayed you here - the light-glare on the snail''s body is so bright that the one antenna appears to merge into its body and it''s hard to make out any features, at the front. Nice, tight closeup, though; do you have one of those cameras that has to find a white somewhere in the picture, perhaps?</td>', 'This is a really neat subject, but I think the lighting betrayed you here - the light-glare on the snail''s body is so bright that the one antenna appears to merge into its body and it''s hard to make out any features, at the front. Nice, tight closeup, though; do you have one of those cameras that has to find a white somewhere in the picture, perhaps?', '2003-09-29 00:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
