(433490, 38982, 1143, '<td valign="top">I agree with all the critiques on this one and certainly didn''t expect it to score so high.<br/>I found this little guy in the yard on Sunday and saved him until evening to try some shots. By the time I was ready, he was acting pretty tired and just fell over when I tried putting him on the toothbrush. I only took a handfull of shots before deciding I should just put him back into the jar. Didn''t have a chance to fix the lighting or try for better focus.<br/>I left the jar on the porch so that he would have a chance to crawl out when he felt better. Two days later I went back and discovered why he had acted so sick. On the bottom of the jar was a chrysalis.<br/>So now I have him hanging on a stick in my room. In a few more days we will hopefully have a butterfly!<br/></td>', 'I agree with all the critiques on this one and certainly didn''t expect it to score so high.I found this little guy in the yard on Sunday and saved him until evening to try some shots. By the time I was ready, he was acting pretty tired and just fell over when I tried putting him on the toothbrush. I only took a handfull of shots before deciding I should just put him back into the jar. Didn''t have a chance to fix the lighting or try for better focus.I left the jar on the porch so that he would have a chance to crawl out when he felt better. Two days later I went back and discovered why he had acted so sick. On the bottom of the jar was a chrysalis.So now I have him hanging on a stick in my room. In a few more days we will hopefully have a butterfly!', '2003-09-29 01:18:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(433496, 38283, 5333, '<td valign="top">Way to go!!  :P Congrats</td>', 'Way to go!!  :P Congrats', '2003-09-29 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(433503, 38995, 1143, '<td valign="top">This really deserved to do better. I gave it a 7 even though the focus on the center flower could have been a bit sharper. I like the white on black and the use of dof. Very nice.</td>', 'This really deserved to do better. I gave it a 7 even though the focus on the center flower could have been a bit sharper. I like the white on black and the use of dof. Very nice.', '2003-09-29 01:26:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(433507, 38832, 4871, '<td valign="top">I''m suprised that this shot didn''t do better than it did. I gave it 9! I thought it was great!</td>', 'I''m suprised that this shot didn''t do better than it did. I gave it 9! I thought it was great!', '2003-09-29 01:28:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(433508, 38741, 1143, '<td valign="top">I thought this was really cool. Nice angle and cool use of dof. Really made an interesting shot out of a very ordinary object. Might''ve benefited from better white balance, but I really like how it goes from being an ordinary, recognizable object to a wash of color. Nice work.</td>', 'I thought this was really cool. Nice angle and cool use of dof. Really made an interesting shot out of a very ordinary object. Might''ve benefited from better white balance, but I really like how it goes from being an ordinary, recognizable object to a wash of color. Nice work.', '2003-09-29 01:29:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(433509, 38955, 4871, '<td valign="top">I was going to suggest color, but I really like it in B&amp;W too! The gradients in the colors are really emphasised in B&amp;W and its different. Why does it all have to be in colour?</td>', 'I was going to suggest color, but I really like it in B&W too! The gradients in the colors are really emphasised in B&W and its different. Why does it all have to be in colour?', '2003-09-29 01:29:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(433510, 38283, 3791, '<td valign="top">&gt;&gt; <i>I know I won''t ribbon, but my goal is to be in the top 3 of bugs.</i> <br/>well... you DID get a ribbon and you DID get to the top three bugs! congratulations! great ''double cliche'' shot!</td>', '>> I know I won''t ribbon, but my goal is to be in the top 3 of bugs. well... you DID get a ribbon and you DID get to the top three bugs! congratulations! great ''double cliche'' shot!', '2003-09-29 01:30:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(433519, 38955, 5351, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 - just wanted to say I really like the shot and like the fact that even though the butterfly was not "perfect", it is still very beautiful.  Great shot! :)</td>', 'I gave this a 10 - just wanted to say I really like the shot and like the fact that even though the butterfly was not "perfect", it is still very beautiful.  Great shot! :)', '2003-09-29 01:33:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(433521, 38052, 1143, '<td valign="top">Wow. tough critics! I really like the colors in this one. The black bg helps it stand out. Interesting little insect with very good focus and lighting. I love all of the water on the flower. You might clone out the bottom right corner to just black now that you can edit. Otherwise, I''m not sure that you can really improve on this. It may be possible to burn some of the lighter water areas on the flower so that it isn''t so bright. It''s a very nice macro though!</td>', 'Wow. tough critics! I really like the colors in this one. The black bg helps it stand out. Interesting little insect with very good focus and lighting. I love all of the water on the flower. You might clone out the bottom right corner to just black now that you can edit. Otherwise, I''m not sure that you can really improve on this. It may be possible to burn some of the lighter water areas on the flower so that it isn''t so bright. It''s a very nice macro though!', '2003-09-29 01:34:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(433530, 38406, 2337, '<td valign="top">To those that didn''t get it, welcome to the club :)  It was a referance to a theology question that has been around for the last 5 centuries.  "How many angels can dance on the head of a pin?"...<br/> <br/>Anyone that wants more info on this question should really look into getting a life, but can find more at //www.kencollins.com/poll-06.htm :)<br/> <br/>Oh, and yes, it was not a nail... It was a pin...</td>', 'To those that didn''t get it, welcome to the club :)  It was a referance to a theology question that has been around for the last 5 centuries.  "How many angels can dance on the head of a pin?"... Anyone that wants more info on this question should really look into getting a life, but can find more at //www.kencollins.com/poll-06.htm :) Oh, and yes, it was not a nail... It was a pin...', '2003-09-29 01:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(433535, 38665, 1717, '<td valign="top">congrats on a great pic and ribbon, crab...you rock! :)</td>', 'congrats on a great pic and ribbon, crab...you rock! :)', '2003-09-29 01:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(433539, 38620, 1143, '<td valign="top">I love the color and how you''ve filled the frame here. IMO you should make it softer. Since you already don''t have spot-on-focus, I think you should just go the other way and give it more of a dreamy feel. Judging by the number of comments, this shot has some fans. Now that you can edit, you might burn (darken) a few of the petals behind the main flower so that all of the edges stand out. In particular, the one along the left side.</td>', 'I love the color and how you''ve filled the frame here. IMO you should make it softer. Since you already don''t have spot-on-focus, I think you should just go the other way and give it more of a dreamy feel. Judging by the number of comments, this shot has some fans. Now that you can edit, you might burn (darken) a few of the petals behind the main flower so that all of the edges stand out. In particular, the one along the left side.', '2003-09-29 01:39:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(433542, 38283, 1717, '<td valign="top">jacko! awesome pic...congrats on another ribbon!</td>', 'jacko! awesome pic...congrats on another ribbon!', '2003-09-29 01:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(433548, 38963, 1717, '<td valign="top">congratulations! wonderful macro!</td>', 'congratulations! wonderful macro!', '2003-09-29 01:43:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(433554, 37996, 1143, '<td valign="top">Wow. Sometimes it is just completely obvious that this is a site of amateur photographers. IMO this is a gorgeous shot with lots of artistic merit. It could probably benefit from some post challenge editing to burn the flower so that it will stand out a bit more from the background. Lots of nice comments.. shows that there are quite a few ppl who can appreciate what you''ve done here. You obviously can''t judge how successful your work is by the final score.</td>', 'Wow. Sometimes it is just completely obvious that this is a site of amateur photographers. IMO this is a gorgeous shot with lots of artistic merit. It could probably benefit from some post challenge editing to burn the flower so that it will stand out a bit more from the background. Lots of nice comments.. shows that there are quite a few ppl who can appreciate what you''ve done here. You obviously can''t judge how successful your work is by the final score.', '2003-09-29 01:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(433563, 38181, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey Mav, I gave this one an 8. I like the color, so I''d prefer you didn''t go to b/w. I think the color does add something. I think the focus is good, too. I guess some voters didn''t like it so dark? I thought this would be in the top 10. But then again, it wasn''t a bug.</td>', 'Hey Mav, I gave this one an 8. I like the color, so I''d prefer you didn''t go to b/w. I think the color does add something. I think the focus is good, too. I guess some voters didn''t like it so dark? I thought this would be in the top 10. But then again, it wasn''t a bug.', '2003-09-29 01:49:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(433566, 38670, 1143, '<td valign="top">Arghh. Maybe I should stop going through the shots after the challenge so that I don''t get so othered by the results. Thirty ninth is a very decent finish, but this shot is just gorgeous. The colors and composition are great. There are a couple of bright areas in the center (bottom) of the flower that could be burned a tad maybe. Great flower macro! Definitely one to be proud of.</td>', 'Arghh. Maybe I should stop going through the shots after the challenge so that I don''t get so othered by the results. Thirty ninth is a very decent finish, but this shot is just gorgeous. The colors and composition are great. There are a couple of bright areas in the center (bottom) of the flower that could be burned a tad maybe. Great flower macro! Definitely one to be proud of.', '2003-09-29 01:50:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(433570, 38976, 6870, '<td valign="top">What''s this doing back here? I like it lots!</td>', 'What''s this doing back here? I like it lots!', '2003-09-29 01:51:32.000000', NULL, 0),
