(433713, 38757, 1005, '<td valign="top">Hard to figure from the comments.  Each seems to have taken an element of this photo to either like or not.  <br/>Try this deeper meaning....The background is a poppy flower picture, blurred a bit.  The two poppy pods are turned sideways and pushed together in the shape of an hourglass.  The poppy picture is frozen in time, exemplified by the sideways hourglass, while the poppy pods are are themselves an example of how time goes past, decay happens. <br/> <br/>I really liked this photo and the symbolizm that went with it.</td>', 'Hard to figure from the comments.  Each seems to have taken an element of this photo to either like or not.  Try this deeper meaning....The background is a poppy flower picture, blurred a bit.  The two poppy pods are turned sideways and pushed together in the shape of an hourglass.  The poppy picture is frozen in time, exemplified by the sideways hourglass, while the poppy pods are are themselves an example of how time goes past, decay happens.  I really liked this photo and the symbolizm that went with it.', '2003-09-29 03:39:43.000000', NULL, 0),
