(433735, 38999, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments. Yes this cricket is still alive and is enjoying life now somewhere in the Ural Mountains. Before I took its photo I put it in the fridge for a while and then sprayed a little water on it. I only took about 10 pics of it before it warmed up again and this was the best one.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments. Yes this cricket is still alive and is enjoying life now somewhere in the Ural Mountains. Before I took its photo I put it in the fridge for a while and then sprayed a little water on it. I only took about 10 pics of it before it warmed up again and this was the best one.', '2003-09-29 05:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
