(433890, 38757, 9504, '<td valign="top">Hey Rob,<br/> <br/>I really appreciate your deeper meaning behind the photo, but people don''t give the photos that much thought.  My chess pieces are the same way.  I have the King in check and no one saw it.<br/> <br/>I think in challenges you have a 2 - 5 second window to make an impression.  Thanks for sharing your thoughts about the macro shot you took.  You put a lot of thought into it.<br/> <br/>I found the shadows a bit distracting...but you had a fabulous idea.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-29 09:55:21.</i></td>', 'Hey Rob, I really appreciate your deeper meaning behind the photo, but people don''t give the photos that much thought.  My chess pieces are the same way.  I have the King in check and no one saw it. I think in challenges you have a 2 - 5 second window to make an impression.  Thanks for sharing your thoughts about the macro shot you took.  You put a lot of thought into it. I found the shadows a bit distracting...but you had a fabulous idea.', '2003-09-29 10:54:45.000000', '2003-09-29 10:55:21.000000', 0),
