(441953, 39007, 12940, '<td valign="top">I think the fact that the picture is out of focus in the foreground emphasizes that this is a photograph of a drawing.  If it were all in focus it would have looked like a photo of a pencil superimposed on a drawing.  The slight blurriness gives it depth.  Nice.</td>', 'I think the fact that the picture is out of focus in the foreground emphasizes that this is a photograph of a drawing.  If it were all in focus it would have looked like a photo of a pencil superimposed on a drawing.  The slight blurriness gives it depth.  Nice.', '2003-10-08 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 0),
