(1976937, 38958, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great looking pic, but I can''t seem to find any birds or bees in the pic? ;)<br/> <br/>I personally don''t hate the center-weighted composition, but I feel that it is actualy a bit off-center. Also, it may have benefited from moving more above to pull a bit more of a circular feel from it. That might work to complement the centering better.</td>', 'Great looking pic, but I can''t seem to find any birds or bees in the pic? ;) I personally don''t hate the center-weighted composition, but I feel that it is actualy a bit off-center. Also, it may have benefited from moving more above to pull a bit more of a circular feel from it. That might work to complement the centering better.', '2005-12-25 13:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
